1
00:01:34,641 --> 00:01:36,184
Qué mala suerte tengo...

2
00:01:36,638 --> 00:01:38,306
que me toque hacer guardia
precisamente hoy.

3
00:01:39,015 --> 00:01:41,976
Yo también quería ver el Examen Chunin.

4
00:01:42,435 --> 00:01:43,435
Deja de quejarte.

5
00:01:43,686 --> 00:01:45,855
El Examen Chunin se celebra
dos veces al año.

6
00:01:46,147 --> 00:01:47,816
Tendrás muchas más ocasiones
de verlo.

7
00:01:48,149 --> 00:01:52,153
Pero este año participa ese chaval
del clan Uchiha, ¿no?

8
00:01:52,320 --> 00:01:53,947
Y no voy a tener
ocasión de verlo...

9
00:01:54,661 --> 00:01:56,381
Ahora no podré morir en paz.

10
00:01:58,576 --> 00:01:59,576
¡¿Qué es eso?!

11
00:02:03,553 --> 00:02:04,554
¡Una serpiente gigante!

12
00:02:04,791 --> 00:02:06,459
¡Avisad al Señor Hokage de inmediato!

13
00:02:23,215 --> 00:02:24,615
¡No dejaré que entréis en la aldea!

14
00:02:37,657 --> 00:02:38,926
¡Enviad refuerzos de inmediato!

15
00:02:38,950 --> 00:02:39,763
¡Sí, señor!

16
00:02:52,589 --> 00:02:53,589
¡Shinobi de la Arena!

17
00:03:02,140 --> 00:03:03,720
- <i>¡Iniciad la operación!</i>
- <i>¡Iniciad la operación!</i>

18
00:03:12,015 --> 00:03:12,910
¡Señor Hokage!

19
00:03:13,526 --> 00:03:14,526
¡Dejádmelo a mí!

20
00:03:17,572 --> 00:03:18,572
¡Gaara!

21
00:03:22,202 --> 00:03:23,202
¡Escuadrón Uno, desde arriba!

22
00:03:23,244 --> 00:03:25,580
¡Escuadrón Dos, desde abajo!
¡Proteged a los señores feudales!

23
00:03:33,630 --> 00:03:34,630
¡Estorbáis!

24
00:03:54,859 --> 00:03:56,539
Por fin nos toca a nosotros.

25
00:03:56,778 --> 00:03:58,947
Llevamos tanto tiempo disfrazados...

26
00:03:59,072 --> 00:04:01,741
Estoy que reviento de tanto contenerme.

27
00:04:02,116 --> 00:04:04,577
¡Apestáis a sudor!

28
00:04:04,786 --> 00:04:07,205
Vamos, que somos compañeros, ¿no...?

29
00:04:08,456 --> 00:04:09,791
<i>¡Shinobi del Sonido...!</i>

30
00:04:13,086 --> 00:04:14,086
Raido...

31
00:04:14,629 --> 00:04:15,940
Vamos a salir a
apoyar al Señor Hokage.

32
00:04:15,964 --> 00:04:16,965
¡Cuidado con las trampas!

33
00:04:19,092 --> 00:04:20,092
Hacedlo...

34
00:04:20,802 --> 00:04:21,802
¡Sí, señor!

35
00:04:23,888 --> 00:04:24,806
<i>- Arte ninja:
- Arte ninja:</i>

36
00:04:24,889 --> 00:04:26,809
<i>- ¡Formación de las Cuatro Llamas Violetas!
- ¡Formación de las Cuatro Llamas Violetas!</i>

37
00:04:36,734 --> 00:04:37,734
¡¿Una barrera?!

38
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,663
Señor Kazekage...

39
00:04:52,375 --> 00:04:54,002
¡¿Ninjutsu de barrera, eh?!

40
00:04:55,044 --> 00:04:56,604
No pensé que pudieran burlar al ANBU...

41
00:04:57,380 --> 00:04:58,673
No son shinobi corrientes...

42
00:05:02,302 --> 00:05:04,637
¡¿Qué hacéis aquí?!
¡El Señor Hokage está en peligro!

43
00:05:14,722 --> 00:05:16,974
Qué fastidio...

44
00:05:17,150 --> 00:05:19,861
No pensé que el enemigo estuviera
haciéndose pasar por nuestro propio ANBU...

45
00:05:21,070 --> 00:05:22,947
¡Así que también fue él quien lanzó
el genjutsu!

46
00:05:23,698 --> 00:05:25,742
Sí... no hay duda.

47
00:05:28,745 --> 00:05:30,038
¿Qué está pasando?

48
00:05:30,830 --> 00:05:31,830
¡Para ya, Gaara!

49
00:05:33,572 --> 00:05:36,075
¡Voy a matarlo...!

50
00:05:37,061 --> 00:05:39,267
¡No tiene sentido
seguir con esta pelea!

51
00:05:39,464 --> 00:05:41,132
¡No olvides nuestra misión!

52
00:05:42,091 --> 00:05:43,091
¡Apartaos...!

53
00:05:43,902 --> 00:05:45,628
¡¿Qué estáis haciendo?!

54
00:05:46,220 --> 00:05:48,264
¡La operación ya está en marcha!

55
00:06:00,485 --> 00:06:02,985
¿Qué demonios está pasando?

56
00:06:05,611 --> 00:06:06,611
¡Gaara!

57
00:06:07,950 --> 00:06:08,950
¡¿Qué te pasa?!

58
00:06:11,741 --> 00:06:13,117
¡Su herida es más profunda
de lo que pensaba!

59
00:06:13,873 --> 00:06:16,334
¡Además, su chakra está muy bajo!

60
00:06:16,417 --> 00:06:18,711
¡Idiota! Todo es porque
no esperaste la señal

61
00:06:18,795 --> 00:06:20,963
e intentaste transformarte del todo...

62
00:06:21,172 --> 00:06:22,715
¡¿Qué hacemos?!

63
00:06:23,174 --> 00:06:25,054
¿Estás diciendo que tenemos que hacer
esto sin Gaara?

64
00:06:28,679 --> 00:06:32,225
¡Vosotros dos, marchaos por ahora y
atended las heridas de Gaara!

65
00:06:33,017 --> 00:06:35,061
En cuanto el chakra de Gaara
se haya recuperado...

66
00:06:35,395 --> 00:06:37,021
¡la operación se reanudará!

67
00:06:37,730 --> 00:06:38,730
¡Entendido!

68
00:06:41,651 --> 00:06:42,651
¡¿Y usted, sensei?!

69
00:06:43,111 --> 00:06:45,154
¡Yo los entretendré!

70
00:06:50,618 --> 00:06:53,663
¿Es Orochimaru el anfitrión de esta fiesta?

71
00:06:55,498 --> 00:07:00,336
Quién sabe...
En cualquier caso, subamos el ritmo.

72
00:07:03,673 --> 00:07:04,573
Sasuke...

73
00:07:06,509 --> 00:07:10,138
Lo siento, pero el Examen Chunin termina aquí.

74
00:07:12,223 --> 00:07:14,267
Ya has alcanzado el nivel de Chunin.

75
00:07:15,226 --> 00:07:18,396
¡Si eres un shinobi de la Hoja,
sirve a la Hoja!

76
00:07:19,772 --> 00:07:22,525
Entonces, solo tengo que derrotar a Gaara, ¿no?

77
00:07:22,859 --> 00:07:24,299
Seguimos donde lo dejamos, ¿verdad?

78
00:07:24,569 --> 00:07:25,779
No lo persigas demasiado lejos.

79
00:07:26,094 --> 00:07:29,081
A partir de ahora, ya no es un examen.
¡Es la realidad!

80
00:07:29,991 --> 00:07:32,160
¡Lo que tengo que hacer... sigue siendo lo mismo!

81
00:07:34,162 --> 00:07:35,162
¡No dejaré que pase!

82
00:07:43,171 --> 00:07:44,171
<i>¡Sasuke...!</i>

83
00:07:45,423 --> 00:07:46,591
Vaya, vaya...

84
00:07:47,175 --> 00:07:51,596
Teníamos pensado llevarnos a Sasuke
mientras Gaara causaba una distracción.

85
00:07:52,591 --> 00:07:56,387
Pero no todo sale como se planea.

86
00:07:58,093 --> 00:08:01,012
Ya veo... ¿Conque es eso?

87
00:08:02,172 --> 00:08:07,344
Así que la Hoja Oculta y...
Sasuke eran vuestros objetivos.

88
00:08:07,996 --> 00:08:10,456
¿Tan gran premio es la Hoja?

89
00:08:11,574 --> 00:08:15,453
Más importante aún,
si Gaara vuelve,

90
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:18,706
podré enseñarte algo
mucho más interesante.

91
00:08:19,123 --> 00:08:20,791
Bueno, en fin...

92
00:08:21,459 --> 00:08:25,171
Tu tozudez ha permitido
que superen a la Hoja.

93
00:08:26,047 --> 00:08:27,673
Es mi victoria.

94
00:08:29,300 --> 00:08:32,470
Nada está decidido
hasta el final.

95
00:08:32,970 --> 00:08:35,306
Creo que eso fue lo que te enseñé...

96
00:08:38,309 --> 00:08:39,769
Orochimaru.

97
00:08:41,103 --> 00:08:45,107
Pensé que este día
acabaría llegando.

98
00:08:46,150 --> 00:08:47,193
Sin embargo...

99
00:08:48,361 --> 00:08:52,031
¡No te llevarás mi cabeza tan fácilmente!

100
00:08:53,783 --> 00:08:55,243
Te lo dije, ¿no?

101
00:08:55,618 --> 00:08:59,205
Deberías haber
nombrado a un Quinto Hokage...

102
00:08:59,789 --> 00:09:01,123
Tercer Hokage...

103
00:09:01,958 --> 00:09:05,711
porque tú vas a... morir aquí.

104
00:09:10,383 --> 00:09:11,467
Ese Orochimaru...

105
00:09:12,385 --> 00:09:13,135
¿Qué hacemos?

106
00:09:13,355 --> 00:09:14,775
¿Enviamos refuerzos?

107
00:09:15,179 --> 00:09:18,633
No. Es demasiado peligroso movernos
cuando no conocemos...

108
00:09:18,658 --> 00:09:19,742
la situación completa.

109
00:09:19,976 --> 00:09:22,437
Si el cerebro de todo esto es Orochimaru...

110
00:09:22,770 --> 00:09:23,770
aún más.

111
00:09:25,314 --> 00:09:29,068
¿De verdad Orochimaru... es tan peligroso?

112
00:09:29,986 --> 00:09:31,737
Hace mucho, cuando era niño...

113
00:09:33,072 --> 00:09:36,492
hay algo que recuerdo haber
pensado al ver a ese tipo...

114
00:09:42,037 --> 00:09:44,164
Que no parecía humano...

115
00:09:44,792 --> 00:09:47,962
Que parecía algo
que acababa de tomar forma humana...

116
00:09:50,176 --> 00:09:51,177
Aterrador...

117
00:09:53,009 --> 00:09:55,761
<i>Sencillamente... aterrador.</i>

118
00:09:59,557 --> 00:10:00,557
¡Informe!

119
00:10:01,183 --> 00:10:03,704
¡Ha aparecido una serpiente gigante cerca
de la Puerta Este de la Hoja Oculta!

120
00:10:03,728 --> 00:10:07,106
¡Y tras ella, un centenar
de ninjas de la Arena se están infiltrando en la aldea!

121
00:10:07,648 --> 00:10:09,626
Se encuentran en pleno
combate armado con nuestros shinobi

122
00:10:09,650 --> 00:10:10,730
que patrullaban cerca!

123
00:10:10,776 --> 00:10:13,404
El Escuadrón Uno y el Dos se quedan aquí.
El resto de unidades, a la puerta este.

124
00:10:13,755 --> 00:10:14,255
¡De inmediato!

125
00:10:14,697 --> 00:10:15,276
- ¡Sí, señor!
- ¡Sí, señor!

126
00:10:26,709 --> 00:10:28,419
¡Hasta aquí llegáis!

127
00:10:44,185 --> 00:10:45,645
Son bastantes.

128
00:10:46,024 --> 00:10:47,150
¡Bajamos la guardia!

129
00:10:47,578 --> 00:10:49,385
E incluso el Señor Hokage está siendo atacado...

130
00:10:51,014 --> 00:10:53,725
¡Kakashi! ¡Mira dentro de la barrera!

131
00:10:54,130 --> 00:10:54,715
Sí.

132
00:10:55,404 --> 00:10:56,008
<i>¿Qué...?</i>

133
00:11:02,745 --> 00:11:03,500
¡Orochimaru!

134
00:11:05,206 --> 00:11:06,206
¡¿Orochimaru?!

135
00:11:07,875 --> 00:11:08,959
<i>¿Por qué está ese tipo...?</i>

136
00:11:10,586 --> 00:11:12,546
<i>No me digas
que van a por Sasuke otra vez...</i>

137
00:11:14,423 --> 00:11:15,423
¡Sasuke!

138
00:11:17,468 --> 00:11:18,468
<i>¿Eh?</i>

139
00:11:19,136 --> 00:11:20,346
<i>¿No está...?</i>

140
00:11:33,171 --> 00:11:35,673
Sakura, quédate ahí un momento.

141
00:11:36,555 --> 00:11:38,101
Voy a reducir su número.

142
00:11:52,545 --> 00:11:55,548
¡Maldita sea! Me preocupa
el Señor Hokage, pero...

143
00:11:56,173 --> 00:11:57,341
Déjaselo al ANBU.

144
00:11:58,092 --> 00:11:59,092
Además...

145
00:11:59,427 --> 00:12:02,972
El Señor Hokage no es de los que
caen tan fácilmente.

146
00:12:04,483 --> 00:12:05,483
Pero...

147
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:11,355
Al fin y al cabo, es el Hokage
de la Hoja Oculta.

148
00:12:21,741 --> 00:12:24,785
¿Tan feliz estás que lloras?

149
00:12:25,737 --> 00:12:26,737
¿O...

150
00:12:27,504 --> 00:12:34,552
sientes aunque sea una pizca de tristeza
al pensar en matarme a mí, tu propio maestro?

151
00:12:47,767 --> 00:12:50,060
Antes tenía mucho sueño.

152
00:12:50,311 --> 00:12:52,396
Pero ahora estoy bien despierto.

153
00:12:54,231 --> 00:12:56,859
Eso pensaba.

154
00:13:01,113 --> 00:13:05,618
Sé que no eres de los que
guardan rencor.

155
00:13:05,951 --> 00:13:09,538
No tienes ni objetivo ni motivo.

156
00:13:09,955 --> 00:13:12,249
Mmm... Supongo...

157
00:13:13,083 --> 00:13:15,461
que sí tengo una especie de objetivo.

158
00:13:16,253 --> 00:13:17,880
Si tuviera que explicarlo...

159
00:13:19,256 --> 00:13:22,510
Es interesante ver cosas
que se mueven.

160
00:13:23,302 --> 00:13:26,555
No siento ningún placer si
algo no se mueve.

161
00:13:27,329 --> 00:13:29,498
Como un molino que no gira...

162
00:13:30,059 --> 00:13:33,938
Bueno, puede tener cierto
encanto de vez en cuando.

163
00:13:34,271 --> 00:13:36,941
Pero por lo general,
no vale la pena mirarlo.

164
00:13:38,275 --> 00:13:42,363
Ahora mismo... con un viento que llamo
«la Destrucción de la Hoja»...

165
00:13:42,446 --> 00:13:44,990
quiero hacer girar ese molino.

166
00:13:47,326 --> 00:13:49,703
Sigues siendo el mismo de siempre...

167
00:13:57,336 --> 00:13:58,336
¡Sakura!

168
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:02,675
Mereció la pena enseñarte
entrenamiento de supervivencia con genjutsu

169
00:14:02,700 --> 00:14:04,160
durante el Examen Genin.

170
00:14:04,969 --> 00:14:07,721
Realmente tienes talento para ello.

171
00:14:08,222 --> 00:14:09,222
¿Eh?

172
00:14:09,974 --> 00:14:12,893
¡Libera el genjutsu y
despierta a Naruto y a Shikamaru!

173
00:14:14,436 --> 00:14:16,438
Naruto se pondrá contentísimo.

174
00:14:17,606 --> 00:14:19,606
Por fin le toca una misión
después de tanto tiempo.

175
00:14:20,609 --> 00:14:21,809
¿A qué te refieres con una misión?

176
00:14:22,486 --> 00:14:23,821
Ten cuidado...

177
00:14:25,614 --> 00:14:28,576
Es tu primera misión de rango A
desde lo del País de las Olas.

178
00:14:35,193 --> 00:14:38,238
<i>Siento inquietud...
por ese chakra tan extraño.</i>

179
00:14:47,386 --> 00:14:48,762
Pero entonces,

180
00:14:49,017 --> 00:14:51,092
deberíamos despertar a Ino y a Choji
e ir en un grupo más grande.

181
00:14:51,724 --> 00:14:54,393
Puede que ya haya
bastantes

182
00:14:54,418 --> 00:14:57,132
shinobi de la Arena y del Sonido
infiltrados en la aldea.

183
00:14:59,273 --> 00:15:03,360
Un escuadrón pierde velocidad cuando tiene
más de los cuatro miembros habituales...

184
00:15:03,485 --> 00:15:05,988
y se vuelve difícil
ocultarse del enemigo.

185
00:15:07,907 --> 00:15:11,118
Eso lo aprendiste en las prácticas de patrulla
de la Academia, ¿no?

186
00:15:12,109 --> 00:15:17,099
¡Ah, ya veo! Entonces, si somos un equipo de cuatro,
¿eso significa que vienes con nosotros?

187
00:15:17,124 --> 00:15:19,793
No, yo tengo que quedarme aquí.

188
00:15:20,669 --> 00:15:21,669
<i>¡Técnica de invocación!</i>

189
00:15:25,591 --> 00:15:29,511
¡Pakkun rastreará
a Sasuke por su olor!

190
00:15:30,888 --> 00:15:33,933
N-No me digas...
¿que el cuarto miembro es este cachorro?!

191
00:15:37,061 --> 00:15:42,107
¡Eh, cuidadito, niñata! ¡No te atrevas
a llamarme «mono» ni «cachorro»!

192
00:15:43,275 --> 00:15:45,653
<i>No he dicho... mono.</i>

193
00:15:46,487 --> 00:15:49,949
¡Vale, Sakura! ¡Libera el genjutsu
de Naruto y Shikamaru!

194
00:15:50,699 --> 00:15:51,247
¡Vale!

195
00:16:07,132 --> 00:16:08,132
<i>¡Liberación!</i>

196
00:16:16,642 --> 00:16:18,310
¿Qué pasa... Sakura?

197
00:16:19,017 --> 00:16:19,907
¡Agáchate!

198
00:16:21,355 --> 00:16:23,524
¡Ya te lo explicaré!
¡Quédate agachado!

199
00:16:28,951 --> 00:16:32,204
Shikamaru, estabas despierto
desde el principio...

200
00:16:35,368 --> 00:16:37,119
¡Ayyy!

201
00:16:37,496 --> 00:16:39,873
¡¿Tú también disipaste el genjutsu?!

202
00:16:40,124 --> 00:16:42,084
¡¿Por qué fingías
estar dormido?!

203
00:16:42,459 --> 00:16:45,254
¡Já! ¡No quiero
acabar metido en esto!

204
00:16:45,501 --> 00:16:48,755
Ni hablar...
¡Sasuke me da igual!

205
00:16:51,844 --> 00:16:53,303
¡Ayyy!

206
00:16:57,266 --> 00:16:59,601
¿Q-Qué está pasando...?

207
00:16:59,935 --> 00:17:00,935
¡Naruto! ¡Detrás de ti!

208
00:17:04,398 --> 00:17:05,691
Q-Qué rápido...

209
00:17:05,858 --> 00:17:07,401
No solo rápido...

210
00:17:11,321 --> 00:17:12,321
¡Guy-sensei!

211
00:17:14,950 --> 00:17:16,535
¡Ahora anunciaré la misión!

212
00:17:17,077 --> 00:17:19,677
En cuanto tengáis las órdenes,
pasad por ese agujero.

213
00:17:20,372 --> 00:17:23,167
¡Localizad a Sasuke,
reuníos con él y detenedlo!

214
00:17:23,542 --> 00:17:26,253
Después, esperad nuevas órdenes
en un lugar seguro.

215
00:17:26,962 --> 00:17:29,214
¿Eh? ¡¿Le ha pasado algo
a Sasuke?!

216
00:17:29,882 --> 00:17:31,258
¡Os lo explico por el camino!

217
00:17:32,342 --> 00:17:33,342
¡Vamos!

218
00:17:34,970 --> 00:17:37,056
En serio... ¿Por qué yo?

219
00:17:37,431 --> 00:17:38,557
¡Eh, chaval!

220
00:17:38,932 --> 00:17:39,600
¿Eh?

221
00:17:39,808 --> 00:17:41,727
Si esta misión sale bien,

222
00:17:41,977 --> 00:17:45,022
como recompensa te dejaré
tocarme las almohadillas.

223
00:17:45,272 --> 00:17:46,815
¡Así que no pongas esa cara!

224
00:17:46,982 --> 00:17:47,775
¿Eh?

225
00:17:47,983 --> 00:17:49,068
¿Ves?

226
00:17:49,818 --> 00:17:51,320
¡Son suaves y blanditas!

227
00:17:51,612 --> 00:17:53,238
¿B-Blanditas...?

228
00:17:53,739 --> 00:17:55,074
Sí, mucho...

229
00:17:56,742 --> 00:17:59,620
¡Suaves y blanditas!

230
00:18:03,916 --> 00:18:05,084
¡Vámonos ya!

231
00:18:07,294 --> 00:18:08,295
¡E-Eh!

232
00:18:11,924 --> 00:18:13,592
¿Estarán bien ellos solos?

233
00:18:14,301 --> 00:18:17,387
Estarán bien.
Pakkun va con ellos.

234
00:18:18,596 --> 00:18:20,639
<i>Mientras no se alejen demasiado...</i>

235
00:18:36,198 --> 00:18:39,409
Esta barrera solo se puede romper
desde dentro.

236
00:18:40,744 --> 00:18:44,289
Si el Señor Hokage tan solo
eliminara a uno de esos cuatro,

237
00:18:44,373 --> 00:18:45,707
podríamos ayudar...

238
00:18:45,999 --> 00:18:48,168
¡Levantad también una barrera por dentro!

239
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:05,561
Mmm... Parece que no voy a poder
salir de esta tan fácilmente.

240
00:19:06,645 --> 00:19:08,605
No lo dices en serio.

241
00:19:08,647 --> 00:19:13,986
Sería más problemático para ti
que alguien más interfiriera, ¿verdad?

242
00:19:21,076 --> 00:19:22,578
<i>Algo va mal...</i>

243
00:19:23,370 --> 00:19:26,331
<i>Todas las clases de la Academia
están en estudio libre.</i>

244
00:19:27,639 --> 00:19:28,849
<i>Y ese humo...</i>

245
00:19:30,373 --> 00:19:32,373
<i>Viene de la dirección
del recinto del examen.</i>

246
00:19:34,631 --> 00:19:37,092
<i>¿No hay una especie de disturbio
hacia el este?</i>

247
00:19:37,926 --> 00:19:40,012
<i>Me pregunto si habrá pasado algo...</i>

248
00:19:41,471 --> 00:19:43,243
<i>¡Esto es rarísimo!</i>

249
00:19:44,391 --> 00:19:48,270
¡Pero este estudio libre repentino
es un rollo!

250
00:19:48,495 --> 00:19:50,497
¡Llevamos así un buen rato!

251
00:19:50,522 --> 00:19:54,026
Sí, Iruka-sensei
y los demás llegan tarde...

252
00:19:54,443 --> 00:19:56,195
¿Verdad, Konohamaru?

253
00:20:00,486 --> 00:20:04,326
¡Tenemos informes de que varias unidades enemigas
ya se han infiltrado en la aldea!

254
00:20:05,454 --> 00:20:09,458
¡Deberíamos evacuar a los alumnos
a un lugar seguro de inmediato!

255
00:20:09,708 --> 00:20:14,087
Sí... ¡Y sin causar pánico
entre los alumnos!

256
00:20:14,671 --> 00:20:17,132
Entonces, evacuemos a los alumnos

257
00:20:17,432 --> 00:20:19,614
lo antes posible con el pretexto
de un simulacro de evacuación.

258
00:20:23,639 --> 00:20:25,974
¿Preveías cuáles serían tus últimos momentos?

259
00:21:01,593 --> 00:21:05,013
No seré blando contigo
solo porque ya estés decrépito.

260
00:21:06,723 --> 00:21:08,308
Lo espero con ganas.

261
00:21:08,850 --> 00:21:10,686
Dependiendo de tu jutsu,

262
00:21:10,727 --> 00:21:14,314
¡puede que tenga que mandarte
de vuelta a la Academia!

263
00:21:16,566 --> 00:21:19,194
¡Por favor, no me decepciones demasiado!

264
00:21:29,329 --> 00:21:31,415
<i>¡Técnica de Clones de Sombra del Shuriken!</i>

265
00:21:37,254 --> 00:21:39,506
<i>¡Invocación, Reencarnación al Mundo Impío!</i>

266
00:21:40,048 --> 00:21:41,048
<i>¡Uno!</i>

267
00:21:42,301 --> 00:21:44,344
Está usando una técnica de invocación
como escudo.

268
00:21:45,053 --> 00:21:46,596
Y esta persona reanimada...

269
00:21:46,763 --> 00:21:47,763
<i>¡Dos!</i>

270
00:21:50,058 --> 00:21:52,060
¡Tengo que detener al tercero,
pase lo que pase!

271
00:21:52,519 --> 00:21:53,519
<i>¡Tres!</i>

272
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:09,619
<i>Parece que el tercero no lo consiguió...
En fin...</i>

273
00:22:22,174 --> 00:22:24,551
¡N-No puede ser!
¡Esas figuras son...!

274
00:22:25,385 --> 00:22:26,887
¿Esas figuras son?

275
00:22:27,596 --> 00:22:32,017
Ahora bien, ¿qué harás,
Sarutobi-sensei...?

276
00:22:32,642 --> 00:22:33,642
<i>No...</i>

277
00:22:44,279 --> 00:22:46,823
Cuánto tiempo... Saru.

278
00:22:47,090 --> 00:22:51,219
Vaya, eres tú...
Has envejecido, Sarutobi.

279
00:22:51,995 --> 00:22:57,417
Nunca imaginé que volvería a veros
a los dos así...

280
00:22:58,637 --> 00:23:00,347
Preparaos, por favor...

281
00:23:00,823 --> 00:23:01,866
Señor Primer Hokage...

282
00:23:02,798 --> 00:23:04,049
¡Señor Segundo Hokage!

283
00:23:05,175 --> 00:23:06,676
¿La Reencarnación al Mundo Impío...?

284
00:23:07,494 --> 00:23:10,247
¿Este joven nos invocó con
esa técnica prohibida?

285
00:23:10,931 --> 00:23:12,265
Este es de cuidado...

286
00:23:14,226 --> 00:23:16,144
Entonces, ¡Sarutobi!

287
00:23:16,642 --> 00:23:21,230
¿Esto significa que debemos... luchar contra ti?

288
00:23:21,817 --> 00:23:24,611
Ya basta de la reunión de viejos...

289
00:23:24,986 --> 00:23:26,655
¿Empezamos?

290
00:23:27,406 --> 00:23:30,200
Siempre se trata de luchar...
sin importar la época.

291
00:23:31,993 --> 00:23:33,328
Eso te gusta, ¿verdad?

292
00:23:33,671 --> 00:23:39,134
¡Nada bueno puede salir de profanar a los muertos
y usarlos como herramientas!

293
00:23:46,007 --> 00:23:48,927
¡Ya lo entiendo! ¡Así que fue eso!

294
00:23:49,292 --> 00:23:51,836
¡Ese Sasuke, poniéndose impaciente!

295
00:23:52,722 --> 00:23:57,185
¿Por qué tengo que meterme yo?
Qué rollo...

296
00:23:58,353 --> 00:23:59,479
¡No hay más remedio!

297
00:24:00,135 --> 00:24:02,054
Son órdenes de Kakashi-sensei.

298
00:24:06,289 --> 00:24:06,998
¡Por aquí!

299
00:24:10,532 --> 00:24:11,674
¿Cuánto tardaremos
en alcanzarlo?

300
00:24:12,367 --> 00:24:15,662
No lo sé.
Va a bastante buena velocidad.

301
00:24:16,238 --> 00:24:17,406
¡Maldita sea!

302
00:24:43,106 --> 00:24:45,442
¡Eh! Daos prisa.

303
00:24:45,734 --> 00:24:46,818
¿Eh? ¿Qué pasa?

304
00:24:47,027 --> 00:24:48,862
¿Habéis encontrado a Sasuke?

305
00:24:49,292 --> 00:24:50,021
¡No!

306
00:24:50,314 --> 00:24:52,691
Hay ocho personas en
dos escuadrones detrás de nosotros...

307
00:24:53,283 --> 00:24:53,873
No...

308
00:24:54,659 --> 00:24:57,579
Hay uno más...
Eso hace nueve siguiéndonos.

309
00:24:57,746 --> 00:24:58,746
¡¿Qué?!

310
00:24:59,039 --> 00:25:02,417
Venga ya. ¡¿Ya?!
¡Dame un respiro!

311
00:25:11,384 --> 00:25:13,553
Probablemente todos sean
Chunin o de rango superior.

312
00:25:14,179 --> 00:25:16,223
Nos aniquilarán
si nos alcanzan.

313
00:25:17,098 --> 00:25:18,098
<i>Aniquilados...</i>

314
00:25:18,519 --> 00:25:22,607
¡Maldita sea! Si hemos llegado a esto,
¡¿por qué no montamos una emboscada?!

315
00:25:23,075 --> 00:25:24,075
¿Una emboscada?

316
00:25:24,633 --> 00:25:25,633
Eso es.

317
00:25:26,566 --> 00:25:29,110
Efectivamente, una emboscada
nos sería ventajosa.

318
00:25:29,548 --> 00:25:32,259
Aunque el enemigo tenga el doble
de gente que nosotros,

319
00:25:32,874 --> 00:25:34,204
si simplemente los pillamos desprevenidos...

320
00:25:35,033 --> 00:25:36,076
Eso no sirve.

321
00:25:36,852 --> 00:25:40,313
Nuestros oponentes son seguidores del shinobi renegado
de la Hoja, Orochimaru.

322
00:25:41,206 --> 00:25:43,959
En el peor de los casos,
podría haber Jonin.

323
00:25:45,284 --> 00:25:48,663
Pensé que funcionaría,
pero supongo que no, ¿eh?

324
00:25:49,109 --> 00:25:51,027
Espera. ¿Por qué?

325
00:25:51,508 --> 00:25:54,761
El nivel del oponente no tiene
mucho que ver con una emboscada.

326
00:25:55,095 --> 00:25:57,514
No lo entendéis.

327
00:25:58,139 --> 00:26:02,811
Escuchad. En efecto, una emboscada es
una táctica fundamental muy ventajosa.

328
00:26:03,130 --> 00:26:06,092
Pero se necesitan dos condiciones.

329
00:26:06,474 --> 00:26:07,474
La primera.

330
00:26:07,721 --> 00:26:12,309
Los perseguidos deben moverse
en silencio y avistar antes a sus perseguidores.

331
00:26:13,386 --> 00:26:14,386
La segunda.

332
00:26:15,012 --> 00:26:17,139
Hay que ser capaz de pillar
desprevenidos a los perseguidores,

333
00:26:17,242 --> 00:26:21,246
asegurar un punto estratégico desde el que
infligir daño con garantías

334
00:26:21,496 --> 00:26:23,290
y ocultarse rápidamente.

335
00:26:24,165 --> 00:26:28,628
Una emboscada solo resulta eficaz
cuando se garantizan estas dos condiciones.

336
00:26:30,730 --> 00:26:33,650
Bueno, la primera condición
no será tan difícil,

337
00:26:33,675 --> 00:26:35,343
ya que contamos con el olfato
del ninja perro.

338
00:26:36,094 --> 00:26:39,472
Y la segunda también
parece ventajosa a primera vista,

339
00:26:39,556 --> 00:26:43,101
ya que conocemos la geografía
de nuestra aldea.

340
00:26:43,435 --> 00:26:46,155
Es probable que informaran a nuestros perseguidores
sobre el terreno de esta aldea

341
00:26:46,180 --> 00:26:50,101
y que hayan hecho simulacros para
este tipo de enfrentamiento.

342
00:26:50,609 --> 00:26:51,443
Y encima,

343
00:26:51,468 --> 00:26:55,347
es probable que todos sean ninjas
hábiles en el arte de la persecución.

344
00:26:56,156 --> 00:26:58,283
Así que están preparados
para nuestras tácticas habituales, ¿eh?

345
00:26:58,825 --> 00:27:02,871
Bueno, aun así, sigue siendo cierto
que una emboscada es ventajosa.

346
00:27:03,288 --> 00:27:05,128
Pero hay demasiados elementos
de incertidumbre.

347
00:27:05,624 --> 00:27:10,503
Para empezar, el enemigo es una unidad especial,
formada específicamente para esta operación.

348
00:27:11,019 --> 00:27:13,730
Mientras que nosotros tenemos...
a un idiota...

349
00:27:14,466 --> 00:27:16,468
a una kunoichi que no tiene nada de especial...

350
00:27:17,677 --> 00:27:18,677
a un perro...

351
00:27:19,524 --> 00:27:22,652
¡y a mí, el vago número uno!

352
00:27:23,661 --> 00:27:27,456
Una táctica consiste en captar sin falta
las condiciones que se dan

353
00:27:27,687 --> 00:27:29,481
y formular un plan óptimo.

354
00:27:30,482 --> 00:27:34,444
Así que solo hay una cosa
que podemos hacer ahora...

355
00:27:35,221 --> 00:27:36,221
¿Una?

356
00:27:36,863 --> 00:27:39,491
Una distracción disfrazada
de emboscada.

357
00:27:40,248 --> 00:27:43,167
Una persona se quedará,
fingirá una emboscada,

358
00:27:43,662 --> 00:27:44,954
y retrasará a los perseguidores.

359
00:27:46,331 --> 00:27:48,917
Si hacemos eso, podremos
despistar a nuestros perseguidores,

360
00:27:49,084 --> 00:27:51,004
pero quien haga de señuelo
probablemente...

361
00:27:54,748 --> 00:27:55,527
Morirá.

362
00:28:03,723 --> 00:28:05,392
Entonces, ¿quién lo va a hacer?

363
00:28:06,434 --> 00:28:08,770
Necesitamos que el perro siga a Sasuke.

364
00:28:09,950 --> 00:28:11,035
Eso significa...

365
00:28:18,177 --> 00:28:19,428
Está bien...

366
00:28:20,198 --> 00:28:22,200
- Yo...
- Supongo que tengo que ser yo.

367
00:28:22,575 --> 00:28:23,575
¡¿Shikamaru?!

368
00:28:24,053 --> 00:28:25,596
¡¿P-Por qué tú?!

369
00:28:26,746 --> 00:28:29,124
Es mejor que
que nos aniquilen, ¿no?

370
00:28:30,250 --> 00:28:31,250
Además, entre nosotros,

371
00:28:31,584 --> 00:28:33,595
el único que está
más capacitado para hacer de cebo

372
00:28:33,620 --> 00:28:36,373
y quien tiene
más posibilidades de sobrevivir...

373
00:28:38,925 --> 00:28:40,885
soy yo.

374
00:28:44,453 --> 00:28:48,582
Mi Técnica de la Sombra Imitadora se diseñó originalmente
como táctica dilatoria, así que...

375
00:28:49,853 --> 00:28:52,021
Bueno, ¡os alcanzaré luego!

376
00:28:52,709 --> 00:28:53,960
Ahora, marchaos

377
00:28:59,494 --> 00:29:01,663
¡Contamos contigo, Shikamaru!

378
00:29:07,245 --> 00:29:10,707
<i>Nunca supe que Shikamaru podía
ser tan fiable.</i>

379
00:29:20,133 --> 00:29:21,509
Sus zancadas son irregulares.

380
00:29:22,218 --> 00:29:24,888
Probablemente la urgencia esté aumentando
su fatiga.

381
00:29:32,103 --> 00:29:33,188
Siento eso.

382
00:29:33,970 --> 00:29:37,098
Se supone que soy yo
el que se raja primero.

383
00:29:39,110 --> 00:29:42,530
Supongo que esta vez no estoy actuando
como de costumbre.

384
00:29:44,574 --> 00:29:46,284
Lo de que estoy cansado es verdad.

385
00:29:46,743 --> 00:29:48,411
Esas huellas están mal.

386
00:29:49,746 --> 00:29:53,333
Por cierto, así es
la huella de un perro de verdad.

387
00:29:57,295 --> 00:29:59,547
Ah, si todavía es un crío.

388
00:30:00,089 --> 00:30:02,467
Pensar que nos pillarían así a todos.

389
00:30:03,009 --> 00:30:06,513
¿Así que esta es la famosa
Técnica de Imitación de Sombra de la Hoja Oculta?

390
00:30:06,920 --> 00:30:07,673
¿Eh?

391
00:30:08,348 --> 00:30:10,391
¡Esa es una forma anticuada de llamarla!

392
00:30:11,351 --> 00:30:13,186
¡Los tiempos cambian!

393
00:30:13,561 --> 00:30:17,106
Ahora se llama
Técnica de la Sombra Imitadora, abuelo.

394
00:30:21,861 --> 00:30:25,198
<i>1, 2, 3, 4...</i>

395
00:30:25,907 --> 00:30:29,702
<i>5, 6, 7... 8.</i>

396
00:30:30,245 --> 00:30:31,245
<i>Ocho personas...</i>

397
00:30:32,121 --> 00:30:34,999
<i>Ocho... No, hay uno más...</i>

398
00:30:35,667 --> 00:30:37,210
<i>Hay nueve personas siguiéndonos.</i>

399
00:30:37,710 --> 00:30:42,131
<i>Tal como pensaba. El papel del noveno
es cubrirse de una posible emboscada.</i>

400
00:30:43,049 --> 00:30:44,843
<i>Esa persona
se mantiene a una distancia fija,</i>

401
00:30:44,926 --> 00:30:48,054
<i>se queda atrás para contrarrestar
cualquier ataque enemigo.</i>

402
00:30:50,223 --> 00:30:55,979
<i>Pero... ¡esto dejará claro dónde
se esconde esa persona!</i>

403
00:31:03,450 --> 00:31:04,450
<i>¡¿Ahí, eh?!</i>

404
00:31:09,033 --> 00:31:11,953
<i>Maldita sea... La sombra no llega.</i>

405
00:31:12,704 --> 00:31:15,081
<i>No tengo suficiente aguante para
extenderla más con mi chakra.</i>

406
00:31:16,374 --> 00:31:18,676
Parece que has llegado a tu límite...

407
00:31:19,085 --> 00:31:21,629
Esta Técnica de la Sombra Imitadora
se romperá muy pronto.

408
00:31:22,213 --> 00:31:23,256
¡Prepárate!

409
00:31:34,934 --> 00:31:38,229
<i>Solo quería ser...
un ninja del montón,</i>

410
00:31:38,646 --> 00:31:40,231
<i>ganar una cantidad decente de dinero,</i>

411
00:31:40,565 --> 00:31:42,901
<i>casarme con una mujer perfectamente normal</i>

412
00:31:42,942 --> 00:31:44,611
<i>que no fuera ni guapa ni fea,</i>

413
00:31:45,028 --> 00:31:46,863
<i>y tener dos hijos, nada especial.</i>

414
00:31:47,405 --> 00:31:50,408
<i>Primero una niña,
y luego un niño...</i>

415
00:31:51,242 --> 00:31:54,203
<i>Me retiraría de ser ninja
cuando mi hija se casara</i>

416
00:31:54,287 --> 00:31:55,872
<i>y mi hijo se hubiera convertido
en un adulto respetable.</i>

417
00:31:56,378 --> 00:31:59,881
<i>Y entonces me lo tomaría con calma
en mi jubilación,</i>

418
00:32:00,236 --> 00:32:02,252
<i>jugando al shogi
y al go todo el día.</i>

419
00:32:03,024 --> 00:32:05,443
<i>Luego moriría de viejo
antes que mi mujer.</i>

420
00:32:06,883 --> 00:32:08,801
<i>Esa vida habría estado bien.</i>

421
00:32:10,670 --> 00:32:12,672
<i>Vaya rollo, esto...</i>

422
00:32:16,225 --> 00:32:19,270
Como has dicho,
parece que he llegado a mi límite.

423
00:32:29,989 --> 00:32:32,241
Eh, sal de ahí.

424
00:32:33,170 --> 00:32:35,798
Ya que estás, córtale la cabeza.

425
00:32:47,882 --> 00:32:49,759
Por fin os he alcanzado.

426
00:32:50,426 --> 00:32:52,261
¿¡A-Asuma?! ¿Por qué?

427
00:33:11,698 --> 00:33:14,450
Bien hecho, Shikamaru.

428
00:33:19,205 --> 00:33:21,165
Je... Esto no es lo mío, la verdad.

429
00:33:22,894 --> 00:33:25,731
<i>Puedes quedarte fuera esta vez.
Ya has hecho bastante.</i>

430
00:33:34,729 --> 00:33:36,189
Entonces, ¿qué pasa, Temari?

431
00:33:37,181 --> 00:33:39,809
Está cerca.
Está justo ahí.

432
00:33:40,226 --> 00:33:41,686
¡Maldita sea! ¿Qué hacemos?

433
00:33:43,855 --> 00:33:45,065
Déjamelo a mí.

434
00:34:10,498 --> 00:34:11,874
Eso ha estado cerca.

435
00:34:13,801 --> 00:34:15,219
¿Qué ha sido ese ruido?

436
00:34:17,847 --> 00:34:22,643
Una explosión...
Puede que fuera una trampa para Sasuke.

437
00:34:23,810 --> 00:34:25,890
Me pregunto si estará bien.

438
00:34:26,796 --> 00:34:31,601
No te preocupes...
No caerá tan fácilmente.

439
00:34:35,948 --> 00:34:38,451
Bueno, ¿empezamos?

440
00:34:39,250 --> 00:34:44,672
Antes de eso, debo hacer que ambos
recuperéis vuestras formas originales.

441
00:34:45,875 --> 00:34:49,545
Prepárate, por favor,
Sarutobi-sensei.

442
00:35:30,670 --> 00:35:32,797
<i>Con cada instante,
tienen más vitalidad...</i>

443
00:35:33,214 --> 00:35:35,508
¿Qué clase de jutsu es ese?

444
00:35:36,592 --> 00:35:37,677
Reencarnación al Mundo Impío.

445
00:35:38,553 --> 00:35:42,807
Es una técnica de invocación prohibida que puede traer
a los muertos de vuelta al mundo de los vivos.

446
00:35:45,351 --> 00:35:49,856
El coste de una técnica de invocación normal
es la sangre de quien la lanza.

447
00:35:50,773 --> 00:35:51,834
Pero he oído que con esta técnica,

448
00:35:51,858 --> 00:35:54,902
para invocar
a un alma muerta a este mundo...

449
00:35:55,653 --> 00:36:01,701
se sacrifica el cuerpo de una persona viva
como recipiente para el alma.

450
00:36:02,577 --> 00:36:06,330
Polvo y tierra cubren entonces
el cuerpo sacrificado,

451
00:36:06,998 --> 00:36:10,501
haciendo que adopte el aspecto original
del alma invocada.

452
00:36:11,252 --> 00:36:14,380
Y mediante el talismán
incrustado en la cabeza,

453
00:36:14,755 --> 00:36:17,008
se suprime la personalidad del alma

454
00:36:17,633 --> 00:36:19,969
y se convierte en poco más
que una marioneta asesina.

455
00:36:23,306 --> 00:36:24,432
Ya están completos.

456
00:36:25,892 --> 00:36:29,854
Se parecen más que nunca
a como solían ser.

457
00:36:30,529 --> 00:36:34,041
¿Conoces la alegría y la sensación
de logro

458
00:36:34,066 --> 00:36:37,236
de herir al hombre
al que una vez llamaste maestro?

459
00:36:38,178 --> 00:36:43,433
Preparé este escenario
para que pudieras conocer esa alegría.

460
00:36:44,324 --> 00:36:46,159
Así que disfrútalo, por favor.

461
00:36:58,216 --> 00:36:59,216
¡Señor Hokage!

462
00:36:59,759 --> 00:37:01,761
Aunque la forma y el aspecto
sean los mismos...

463
00:37:02,011 --> 00:37:05,806
¡no son ni el Primer Hokage
ni el Segundo!

464
00:37:07,516 --> 00:37:09,101
¡Lo... sé!

465
00:37:26,661 --> 00:37:28,037
¡Allá voy!

466
00:37:29,705 --> 00:37:31,749
<i>¡Técnica ígnea: Bala de Fuego del Dragón!</i>

467
00:38:00,152 --> 00:38:03,322
Digno del título
del antiguo Hokage.

468
00:38:07,159 --> 00:38:09,203
<i>¡Técnica acuática: Onda de Choque de Agua!</i>

469
00:38:19,839 --> 00:38:21,716
<i>¡Técnica terrestre: Muro de Barro!</i>

470
00:39:16,687 --> 00:39:19,398
<i>La misma fuerza formidable de siempre.</i>

471
00:39:30,159 --> 00:39:33,579
<i>Luchar contra los dos a la vez es todo
un reto, como cabía esperar...</i>

472
00:40:15,037 --> 00:40:16,037
Esto es malo.

473
00:40:16,539 --> 00:40:19,041
Esta es la técnica secreta del Primer Hokage.

474
00:40:21,836 --> 00:40:23,254
<i>Técnica secreta de madera:</i>

475
00:40:28,384 --> 00:40:30,052
<i>¡Aparición del Bosque Profundo!</i>

476
00:41:04,962 --> 00:41:08,883
Por fin te he atrapado...
¿eh, maestro?

477
00:41:16,223 --> 00:41:18,392
Bien. Estáis todos aquí, ¿verdad?

478
00:41:19,059 --> 00:41:22,188
Vale, chicos,
evacuemos rápido.

479
00:41:26,585 --> 00:41:28,694
¡No corráis y no os asustéis!

480
00:41:29,528 --> 00:41:32,323
¿Qué te pasa, Konohamaru?

481
00:41:33,240 --> 00:41:34,867
¿Te duele la barriga o algo?

482
00:41:35,951 --> 00:41:39,205
No... no es eso.

483
00:41:55,387 --> 00:41:57,223
<i>¡Arte ninja: Técnica de invocación!</i>

484
00:41:57,681 --> 00:41:58,557
¡Aparece!

485
00:41:58,682 --> 00:42:00,476
¡Rey de los Monos: Enma!

486
00:42:12,738 --> 00:42:16,325
Já...
Ha aparecido algo molesto, ¿eh?

487
00:42:20,746 --> 00:42:22,456
El viejo mono Enma.

488
00:42:31,464 --> 00:42:35,426
Orochimaru...
Sabía que llegaríamos a esto.

489
00:42:36,929 --> 00:42:41,392
Eres patético, Sarutobi...
Si tan solo lo hubieras matado entonces.

490
00:42:42,268 --> 00:42:43,769
¡Voy a hacerlo ahora!

491
00:42:45,271 --> 00:42:46,647
Es demasiado tarde.

492
00:42:50,276 --> 00:42:53,654
¡Por favor, Enma!
El Báculo Adamantino.

493
00:42:55,531 --> 00:42:58,200
¡Deténlo! ¡No dejes que complete
esa transformación!

494
00:43:01,870 --> 00:43:03,664
Vale... ¡Entendido!

495
00:43:13,465 --> 00:43:14,465
<i>¡Transfórmate!</i>

496
00:43:21,932 --> 00:43:22,932
Muy bien.

497
00:43:29,481 --> 00:43:33,110
Vaya... ¡Qué nivel de ninjutsu!

498
00:43:34,069 --> 00:43:36,655
¡Así que esto es un combate de nivel Hokage!

499
00:43:37,823 --> 00:43:42,661
En fin...
Por fin se ha puesto interesante esto.

500
00:43:54,814 --> 00:43:57,442
<i>Esa es una de sus espadas serpiente.</i>

501
00:44:05,267 --> 00:44:06,602
¡Vamos allá, Enma!

502
00:44:07,353 --> 00:44:11,774
Por muy fuerte que sea el cuerpo,
la espada serpiente sigue doliendo.

503
00:45:07,996 --> 00:45:08,996
¡Eres mío!

504
00:45:15,509 --> 00:45:16,509
Qué necio...

505
00:45:17,131 --> 00:45:21,093
Pensar que atacarías sin siquiera
usar la Técnica de Clones de Sombra.

506
00:45:22,386 --> 00:45:24,513
¿Estás bien, maestro?

507
00:45:26,107 --> 00:45:28,100
Aguanta, por favor.

508
00:45:29,435 --> 00:45:31,687
Te llaman...

509
00:45:31,712 --> 00:45:36,467
«el Profesor», el que conoce todos
los jutsu de la Hoja Oculta, ¿no?

510
00:45:37,484 --> 00:45:40,279
Por favor, no me decepciones demasiado.

511
00:45:44,055 --> 00:45:45,390
¡Señor Hokage!

512
00:45:46,827 --> 00:45:50,164
Necio... Es demasiado tarde.

513
00:45:55,919 --> 00:45:58,519
Tú... ¡necio!

514
00:46:07,183 --> 00:46:08,518
Orochimaru...

515
00:46:09,266 --> 00:46:10,934
Esto se acaba aquí.

516
00:46:11,477 --> 00:46:13,979
Te romperé el cuello.

517
00:47:10,302 --> 00:47:11,386
<i>Tal como pensaba...</i>

518
00:47:11,411 --> 00:47:15,040
<i>Parece que no sirve de nada si
no hago algo con el alma en sí</i>

519
00:47:15,065 --> 00:47:17,359
<i>que está ligada
a la Reencarnación al Mundo Impío.</i>

520
00:47:19,008 --> 00:47:24,430
<i>Si es así, mi única opción es usar...
el jutsu del Cuarto Hokage...</i>

521
00:47:28,635 --> 00:47:35,895
<i>Señor Primer Hokage, Señor Segundo Hokage,
¡perdonadme por usar esta técnica!</i>

522
00:47:38,313 --> 00:47:43,068
Maestro... parece que te falta el aliento.

523
00:47:43,908 --> 00:47:45,492
Has envejecido, ¿verdad?

524
00:47:45,941 --> 00:47:49,945
Nunca había visto una mirada tan dolorida.

525
00:47:54,705 --> 00:47:56,415
¿Qué tiene tanta gracia?

526
00:47:57,958 --> 00:47:59,501
Es bastante triste...

527
00:48:00,544 --> 00:48:07,175
La vejez te vence hasta a ti,
al que una vez llamaron el Dios de los Shinobi.

528
00:48:10,429 --> 00:48:11,680
¡¿Qué es eso?!

529
00:48:12,264 --> 00:48:13,932
¿Qué demonios está pasando?

530
00:48:15,851 --> 00:48:18,145
¿Quién demonios es ese joven?

531
00:48:20,314 --> 00:48:22,316
¡¿Quién diablos eres?!

532
00:48:23,692 --> 00:48:26,945
¿Es tan repentino que no me reconoces?

533
00:48:27,446 --> 00:48:30,282
Soy yo. Orochimaru.

534
00:48:32,451 --> 00:48:37,247
No puede ser... ¿Has perfeccionado
esa técnica prohibida?

535
00:48:42,920 --> 00:48:46,924
Luché durante décadas...
después de dejar la aldea.

536
00:48:47,549 --> 00:48:50,594
¡Eres un monstruo verdaderamente aterrador
e inhumano!

537
00:49:00,520 --> 00:49:02,522
Así que lo consiguió, ¿eh...?

538
00:49:03,649 --> 00:49:06,860
La razón por la que no pude elegirte
como Cuarto Hokage...

539
00:49:07,819 --> 00:49:09,947
fue por esa
mente retorcida que tienes.

540
00:49:24,002 --> 00:49:26,421
Por fin me han descubierto, ¿eh...?

541
00:49:29,758 --> 00:49:30,926
Qué lástima.

542
00:49:31,385 --> 00:49:35,430
Orochimaru...
¡¿Qué significa esto?!

543
00:49:35,889 --> 00:49:39,559
Y pensar que había puesto
tantas trampas...

544
00:49:41,103 --> 00:49:42,896
así que me sorprendió bastante.

545
00:49:43,563 --> 00:49:46,483
Pero ya veo... Así que eras tú.

546
00:49:47,064 --> 00:49:50,665
Últimamente, ha habido un flujo constante
de gente que desaparece de la aldea,

547
00:49:50,912 --> 00:49:52,976
desde Genin hasta Chunin,
e incluso miembros del ANBU.

548
00:49:53,366 --> 00:49:57,579
También había soplos de que
habías estado actuando de forma extraña...

549
00:49:58,620 --> 00:49:59,746
Maestro Orochimaru...

550
00:49:59,955 --> 00:50:02,207
¿Por qué un shinobi de tu rango
hizo algo así?

551
00:50:04,126 --> 00:50:06,128
¿Debería matarte a ti también?

552
00:50:07,963 --> 00:50:11,883
¡Orochimaru! Así que, efectivamente,
¿esto era cosa tuya?

553
00:50:12,759 --> 00:50:15,470
¡Dilo! ¡¿Qué estabas haciendo aquí?!

554
00:50:15,762 --> 00:50:18,640
Ay, qué pena. Me han descubierto.

555
00:50:18,849 --> 00:50:21,393
Hacerme el inocente no me va a servir...

556
00:50:22,893 --> 00:50:25,980
¡Es para desarrollar jutsu!

557
00:50:27,357 --> 00:50:29,192
Tal como pensaba, técnicas prohibidas, ¿eh...?

558
00:50:31,653 --> 00:50:34,072
¿Qué es lo que quieres?

559
00:50:34,406 --> 00:50:39,911
¡Aprender todos los jutsu y comprender
todas las verdades de este mundo!

560
00:50:40,704 --> 00:50:43,623
Quien primero mezcló
azul y amarillo

561
00:50:43,874 --> 00:50:47,669
llamó al nuevo color
resultante, verde.

562
00:50:48,628 --> 00:50:51,548
Yo solo quiero hacer lo mismo.

563
00:50:52,579 --> 00:50:54,873
Si el azul es el chakra, el amarillo es un signo...

564
00:50:55,177 --> 00:50:57,054
y el verde es un jutsu.

565
00:50:57,779 --> 00:51:01,199
Del mismo modo que no hay
límite a los tipos de colores,

566
00:51:01,224 --> 00:51:04,728
probablemente haya decenas
de miles de jutsu en este mundo...

567
00:51:05,411 --> 00:51:09,207
Pero para
aprender todos los jutsu...

568
00:51:09,232 --> 00:51:14,654
así como las verdades,
hace falta mucho tiempo.

569
00:51:15,447 --> 00:51:20,494
Es quien dedica esos
largos años a saberlo todo

570
00:51:20,744 --> 00:51:23,830
a quien de verdad se puede llamar
el individuo definitivo.

571
00:51:25,874 --> 00:51:29,711
Para mí, la vida útil
del cuerpo es demasiado corta.

572
00:51:30,295 --> 00:51:31,421
Demasiado fugaz.

573
00:51:32,923 --> 00:51:38,720
Aunque uno llegue a Hokage,
si muere, todo termina ahí.

574
00:51:39,221 --> 00:51:43,934
Orochimaru... ¿No será que
el jutsu que estás probando aquí es...?

575
00:51:44,142 --> 00:51:46,978
Sí... Bien podría serlo...

576
00:51:50,649 --> 00:51:53,068
¡Mi Técnica de la Inmortalidad!

577
00:52:02,994 --> 00:52:04,621
La Técnica de la Inmortalidad consiste en

578
00:52:04,826 --> 00:52:08,997
transferir eternamente el propio espíritu
de un recipiente a otro...

579
00:52:09,156 --> 00:52:12,534
Dicho de otro modo,
es un jutsu de reencarnación en el que...

580
00:52:13,130 --> 00:52:18,760
encuentras un cuerpo nuevo, metes tu propio espíritu
en él y te apoderas de él.

581
00:52:23,099 --> 00:52:26,440
He mantenido mi antigua forma hasta ahora,

582
00:52:26,852 --> 00:52:31,606
para que sintieras nostalgia
por nuestro reencuentro...

583
00:52:33,066 --> 00:52:36,361
Envejecer no tiene ningún sentido,
¿no crees?

584
00:52:36,945 --> 00:52:40,490
Lo siento con claridad cuando te miro.

585
00:52:42,075 --> 00:52:44,077
Vas a morir aquí...

586
00:52:44,433 --> 00:52:49,772
y yo conseguiré un cuerpo más joven,
más hermoso y más fuerte...

587
00:52:50,591 --> 00:52:54,554
La Aldea de la Hoja sin duda me proporciona
un entretenimiento sin fin...

588
00:52:57,382 --> 00:53:00,760
Ya veo...
¡Vas tras Sasuke Uchiha!

589
00:53:04,848 --> 00:53:09,436
Así es... Exacto... Sasuke.

590
00:53:10,520 --> 00:53:12,560
¿Un jutsu para reencarnar robando
el cuerpo de otro

591
00:53:12,856 --> 00:53:15,901
y hacer inmortal tu espíritu?

592
00:53:16,526 --> 00:53:20,280
¡¿Por cuántas caras y cuerpos
has pasado ya?!

593
00:53:21,573 --> 00:53:24,201
Dos, creo...

594
00:53:24,576 --> 00:53:29,915
Pienso apoderarme de Sasuke después de
criarlo un poco más a mi gusto.

595
00:53:34,002 --> 00:53:37,714
Pero, al fin y al cabo, para
hacer que te arrepientas de tu propia vida...

596
00:53:37,797 --> 00:53:40,967
y maldigas el destino al morir...

597
00:53:42,052 --> 00:53:45,305
¿Quizá esta cara sea más de tu agrado?

598
00:53:48,141 --> 00:53:49,226
¡Monstruo!

599
00:54:01,821 --> 00:54:02,906
¡Señor Hokage!

600
00:54:08,036 --> 00:54:14,125
¡No bajes la guardia, maestro!
Siempre eres demasiado blando...

601
00:54:21,719 --> 00:54:24,514
¿Qué te ha pasado?
¡Esto no es propio de ti!

602
00:54:24,761 --> 00:54:25,845
Lo siento...

603
00:54:34,729 --> 00:54:38,525
¿Vas a... matarme?

604
00:54:41,432 --> 00:54:43,351
<i>¡Técnica de invocación!</i>

605
00:54:47,784 --> 00:54:53,623
Me pregunto si podrás...
¡Sarutobi-sensei!

606
00:55:11,641 --> 00:55:14,394
¡Mátalo, Sarutobi!
¡Es tu única oportunidad!

607
00:55:34,664 --> 00:55:36,875
Sarutobi... Tú...

608
00:55:38,304 --> 00:55:40,245
No pude matarlo...

609
00:55:43,006 --> 00:55:47,177
¡Te enterraré y corregiré
mis viejos errores, ahora!

610
00:55:48,928 --> 00:55:49,929
¡Allá voy!

611
00:55:52,849 --> 00:55:55,101
¡Es demasiado tarde!

612
00:55:58,313 --> 00:56:00,440
<i>¡Técnica de Clones de Sombra!</i>

613
00:56:02,108 --> 00:56:04,277
¡No puede ser!
¡¿Por qué la Técnica de Clones de Sombra?!

614
00:56:04,694 --> 00:56:07,113
¡Está dispersando el poco chakra
que le queda...!

615
00:56:08,979 --> 00:56:11,148
Después de todo, has envejecido...

616
00:56:11,713 --> 00:56:15,341
Pensar que acortarías tu propia
vida por desesperación...

617
00:56:16,122 --> 00:56:17,624
N-No me digas... ¡¿tú?!

618
00:56:19,793 --> 00:56:23,880
<i>Serpiente, Jabalí, Carnero, Liebre,
Perro, Rata, Ave, Caballo, Serpiente.</i>

619
00:56:26,508 --> 00:56:27,801
<i>Este orden de signos...</i>

620
00:56:28,551 --> 00:56:30,553
<i>Lo sabía, Sarutobi,
estás usando esa técnica!</i>

621
00:56:46,694 --> 00:56:50,407
<i>Así que este es el Dios de la Muerte
del que hablaba el Cuarto,</i>

622
00:56:50,432 --> 00:56:54,902
<i>¿un ser visible solo para quien lo invoca?</i>

623
00:56:55,584 --> 00:56:59,921
Hagas lo que hagas ahora, es demasiado tarde...
He ganado.

624
00:57:00,500 --> 00:57:02,252
¡La Aldea de la Hoja Oculta será destruida!

625
00:57:02,836 --> 00:57:05,505
La Aldea de la Hoja Oculta
es el hogar en el que vivo.

626
00:57:05,839 --> 00:57:11,761
¡El Hokage existe como el pilar
que protege ese hogar!

627
00:57:12,345 --> 00:57:16,015
El Hokage es quien hereda
y a quien se confía la voluntad de la Hoja.

628
00:57:16,224 --> 00:57:18,226
¡No me iré tan fácilmente!

629
00:57:20,186 --> 00:57:22,522
<i>¡Genjutsu: Técnica de la Oscuridad Infinita!</i>

630
00:57:30,530 --> 00:57:32,157
<i>Estupideces...</i>

631
00:57:32,866 --> 00:57:35,326
<i>No eres más que un líder temporal</i>

632
00:57:35,524 --> 00:57:38,860
<i>en la historia de la organización
llamada la Aldea de la Hoja...</i>

633
00:57:46,212 --> 00:57:51,217
<i>Incluso el monumento Hokage que dejes
acabará erosionándose y derrumbándose.</i>

634
00:57:52,343 --> 00:57:57,223
Já... ¡la Hoja Oculta es para mí
mucho más que una simple organización!

635
00:58:01,603 --> 00:58:03,229
En la Aldea de la Hoja,

636
00:58:03,605 --> 00:58:06,858
cada año nacen y se crían
muchos shinobi...

637
00:58:07,066 --> 00:58:11,112
y viven y luchan...
y mueren para proteger la aldea.

638
00:58:37,597 --> 00:58:40,058
La gente de esta aldea...

639
00:58:40,099 --> 00:58:42,727
aunque no tengan lazos de sangre...

640
00:58:44,187 --> 00:58:47,146
para mí son preciados...

641
00:58:48,483 --> 00:58:49,734
preciados...

642
00:58:50,944 --> 00:58:52,445
¡familia!

643
00:59:01,526 --> 00:59:08,659
<i>Entonces te aplastaré a ti, el pilar,
y destruiré la Hoja.</i>

644
00:59:09,295 --> 00:59:15,301
¡Já! Aunque me mates,
¡ese pilar no se romperá!

645
00:59:16,063 --> 00:59:21,569
Soy el hombre que llevó la voluntad
del Primer y el Segundo Hokage...

646
00:59:22,517 --> 00:59:24,163
¡El Tercer Hokage!

647
00:59:25,895 --> 00:59:30,066
Por mucho que ataques
esta Aldea de la Hoja Oculta...

648
00:59:30,316 --> 00:59:35,863
¡Un nuevo Hokage llevará mi voluntad,
se convertirá en ese pilar y defenderá la Hoja!

649
00:59:37,657 --> 00:59:39,284
¿Verdad, Cuarto Hokage?

650
00:59:40,618 --> 00:59:45,999
¡Orochimaru! ¡Ahora realizaré
una técnica que ni siquiera tú conoces!

651
00:59:47,542 --> 00:59:51,754
¡Sé testigo!
<i>¡Técnica de sellado: Sello del Dios de la Muerte!</i>

652
00:59:58,261 --> 01:00:01,389
<i>Tengo que darme prisa...
Esta oscuridad es peligrosa.</i>

653
01:00:06,117 --> 01:00:07,744
<i>Vas a mostrármelo.</i>

654
01:00:16,830 --> 01:00:19,667
<i>Realiza esa técnica, rápido.</i>

655
01:00:20,867 --> 01:00:21,993
<i>¿Todavía no...?</i>

656
01:01:03,660 --> 01:01:06,537
Parece que...
llegué justo a tiempo.

657
01:01:07,455 --> 01:01:10,917
<i>¿Qué te pasa?
Ya estás tropezando...</i>

658
01:01:14,837 --> 01:01:18,424
<i>Ahora solo queda...
¡atraparlos!</i>

659
01:01:21,928 --> 01:01:22,929
<i>¡Te tengo!</i>

660
01:01:30,192 --> 01:01:31,902
<i>¡No te soltaré!</i>

661
01:01:32,814 --> 01:01:34,083
¡Aparece!

662
01:02:13,646 --> 01:02:16,858
<i>La oscuridad ha desaparecido...
¿Qué técnica es esta?</i>

663
01:02:17,817 --> 01:02:19,360
Lo siento... Sarutobi...

664
01:02:24,073 --> 01:02:25,116
Te causamos problemas...

665
01:02:28,161 --> 01:02:29,829
Perdóname, por favor...

666
01:02:30,496 --> 01:02:31,496
¡Señor Primer Hokage!

667
01:02:31,914 --> 01:02:33,332
¡Señor Segundo Hokage!

668
01:02:38,463 --> 01:02:39,756
<i>¡Sellar!</i>

669
01:03:02,695 --> 01:03:04,405
¡Tus propios subordinados...!

670
01:03:05,615 --> 01:03:09,744
¡Jugando incluso con las vidas
de tus propios subordinados...!

671
01:03:10,411 --> 01:03:14,165
¿Las vidas de mis subordinados?
¡No seas absurdo!

672
01:03:17,251 --> 01:03:19,258
¡Ven, Enma!

673
01:03:34,061 --> 01:03:35,061
¡Eres mío!

674
01:03:35,770 --> 01:03:36,896
<i>¡Serpientes de las Sombras!</i>

675
01:03:39,148 --> 01:03:40,148
¡Maldita sea! ¡Serás...!

676
01:03:43,653 --> 01:03:44,779
¡Se acabó!

677
01:03:58,501 --> 01:04:00,503
<i>¿Qué es esta sensación...?</i>

678
01:04:01,003 --> 01:04:02,421
<i>Esto es malo...</i>

679
01:04:15,852 --> 01:04:16,853
- <i>¡Muere!</i>
- <i>¡Muere!</i>

680
01:04:40,251 --> 01:04:42,795
¿Por qué... no lo esquivaste?

681
01:04:47,508 --> 01:04:51,971
No hace falta esquivar.
Voy a morir de todos modos.

682
01:04:53,556 --> 01:04:57,894
Cuando termine el sellado,
mi alma también será devorada.

683
01:04:59,186 --> 01:05:01,856
Esta es la técnica del héroe
que una vez salvó nuestra aldea.

684
01:05:02,231 --> 01:05:06,277
Y ahora, tú también morirás...
¡por esta técnica!

685
01:05:06,694 --> 01:05:12,033
¡¿Así que esta es la técnica que selló
al Zorro de las Nueve Colas, eh?!

686
01:05:14,368 --> 01:05:20,833
¡Tu alma será arrancada...
y sellada!

687
01:05:22,418 --> 01:05:24,462
<i>Mi cuerpo...
¡No puedo controlarlo!</i>

688
01:05:30,217 --> 01:05:32,553
Probablemente puedas verlo pronto.

689
01:05:33,358 --> 01:05:38,947
Tu alma ya está
a medio camino de salir, así que...

690
01:05:39,560 --> 01:05:43,564
Aquellos a quienes se les sella el alma
con esta técnica

691
01:05:43,689 --> 01:05:46,817
sufrirán dentro del estómago
de la Parca por toda la eternidad

692
01:05:46,842 --> 01:05:50,095
y jamás conocerán la paz...

693
01:05:51,197 --> 01:05:56,994
Quien sella y quien es sellado
tienen sus almas entrelazadas,

694
01:05:57,019 --> 01:06:02,107
¡y se odiarán mutuamente,
y seguirán luchando por toda la eternidad!

695
01:06:09,715 --> 01:06:10,715
¡¿Qué...?!

696
01:06:15,638 --> 01:06:17,848
<i>¿Esto es... la Parca?!</i>

697
01:06:19,558 --> 01:06:24,438
¡Detente, viejo necio!
¡No dejaré que te salgas con la tuya!

698
01:06:42,123 --> 01:06:44,417
¡Date prisa y... muere!

699
01:06:59,140 --> 01:07:03,060
Te vengaré
pase lo que pase...

700
01:07:05,268 --> 01:07:05,930
Hayate...

701
01:07:09,650 --> 01:07:11,152
Esa es la señal. ¡Vamos!

702
01:07:11,402 --> 01:07:12,033
¡Entendido!

703
01:07:24,595 --> 01:07:26,346
Tenemos que contenerlos aquí como sea.

704
01:07:27,126 --> 01:07:28,377
¡¿Todavía no ha llegado el refuerzo?!

705
01:07:32,548 --> 01:07:36,844
<i>¡Arte ninja: Invocación,
Técnica de Derribar la Casa!</i>

706
01:07:49,356 --> 01:07:51,358
Cuánto tiempo, Ibiki.

707
01:07:52,013 --> 01:07:55,183
En serio... ¡¿Lo único que te ha crecido
es el cuerpo?!

708
01:07:55,345 --> 01:07:57,139
¡No puedo ni mirarte!

709
01:07:58,074 --> 01:07:59,075
Señor Jiraiya...

710
01:07:59,582 --> 01:08:01,980
¡¿Jiraiya... uno de los Legendarios Sannin?!

711
01:08:02,286 --> 01:08:08,216
¡Muy bien, todos! Abrid bien esos ojillos
y observad con atención.

712
01:08:13,055 --> 01:08:14,598
¡Qué suerte tenéis!

713
01:08:14,699 --> 01:08:19,704
El del legendario ninja Jiraiya...
el Reino del Diablo Más Allá del Horizonte...

714
01:08:22,139 --> 01:08:25,351
¡va a desatarse!

715
01:08:28,437 --> 01:08:32,358
Vosotras, serpientes, os habéis metido
con la rana equivocada. ¡Largo!

716
01:08:35,428 --> 01:08:38,556
Así que Orochimaru por fin ha empezado, ¿eh?

717
01:08:41,586 --> 01:08:42,586
¿Dónde está el Tercer Hokage?

718
01:08:43,742 --> 01:08:44,826
En el recinto del examen.

719
01:08:46,836 --> 01:08:47,836
Ya veo...

720
01:08:49,917 --> 01:08:51,752
No te mueras... viejo.

721
01:08:54,505 --> 01:08:56,549
Vale, todos. ¡En fila!

722
01:09:01,720 --> 01:09:03,139
¡Silencio, todos!

723
01:09:04,557 --> 01:09:06,100
¡Konohamaru!

724
01:09:07,560 --> 01:09:10,020
Konohamaru, no se va
a derrumbar, ¿verdad?

725
01:09:10,271 --> 01:09:12,314
Estará... estará bien.

726
01:09:12,940 --> 01:09:19,155
La estructura de este pasadizo de roca es antigua,
pero la construcción es sólida.

727
01:09:20,656 --> 01:09:23,033
Me lo dijo mi abuelo.

728
01:09:26,745 --> 01:09:30,541
Así que seguro que estará bien.

729
01:09:39,758 --> 01:09:44,430
<i>¿Qué es este cúmulo de olores
que viene de otra dirección?</i>

730
01:09:45,681 --> 01:09:49,518
¡Eh! ¡Algo más está rastreando
a Sasuke, no solo nosotros!

731
01:09:49,935 --> 01:09:50,935
¡¿Qué?!

732
01:09:51,270 --> 01:09:52,980
¿Un enemigo? ¡¿Un aliado?!

733
01:09:53,898 --> 01:09:56,066
No lo sé. Pero...

734
01:09:56,669 --> 01:09:57,465
¿Pero?

735
01:09:59,737 --> 01:10:00,863
No es humano.

736
01:10:01,280 --> 01:10:02,280
¡¿Eh?!

737
01:10:02,364 --> 01:10:03,364
¡¿Eh?!

738
01:10:13,584 --> 01:10:16,462
Temari, llévate a Gaara y adelantaos.

739
01:10:16,717 --> 01:10:17,440
¿Qué?

740
01:10:18,311 --> 01:10:19,938
Estás al límite...

741
01:10:21,328 --> 01:10:23,455
No necesito un estorbo.

742
01:10:23,761 --> 01:10:24,532
¡Pero...!

743
01:10:24,929 --> 01:10:25,732
¡Ve!

744
01:10:27,765 --> 01:10:28,523
Vale...

745
01:10:30,392 --> 01:10:34,271
No hay más remedio...
¡Seré tu oponente!

746
01:10:37,274 --> 01:10:39,235
¡Já! ¡Me da igual quién sea!

747
01:10:39,735 --> 01:10:40,403
¡No!

748
01:10:41,612 --> 01:10:43,405
¡Tu oponente soy yo!

749
01:10:47,999 --> 01:10:48,999
¡Tú...!

750
01:10:51,080 --> 01:10:52,080
¿Shino?

751
01:10:52,623 --> 01:10:54,124
¡¿Qué haces aquí?!

752
01:10:57,231 --> 01:11:01,569
Te puse un escarabajo hembra
antes de que salieras del recinto.

753
01:11:03,083 --> 01:11:05,544
Las hembras casi no tienen olor...

754
01:11:06,929 --> 01:11:11,809
Solo un macho puede olfatear
el sutil aroma de la hembra.

755
01:11:12,709 --> 01:11:15,545
Aunque el propio macho
tiene un olor fuerte...

756
01:11:20,966 --> 01:11:23,885
Sasuke Uchiha, ve tras Gaara.

757
01:11:24,822 --> 01:11:29,159
Porque tu batalla con él
aún no se ha resuelto.

758
01:11:32,663 --> 01:11:38,711
Yo lucharé contra él, porque en un principio
yo era su oponente...

759
01:11:40,421 --> 01:11:42,965
Tienes mucha confianza.
¿Pero vas a estar bien?

760
01:11:44,008 --> 01:11:45,134
No hace falta preocuparse.

761
01:11:46,010 --> 01:11:48,694
Dame diez minutos
e iré a apoyarte.

762
01:11:49,930 --> 01:11:52,850
Já. Para entonces ya habré terminado.

763
01:12:04,361 --> 01:12:07,740
Ninguno de vosotros sabe nada de nada.

764
01:12:08,574 --> 01:12:13,912
Probablemente no conozcáis
el verdadero terror de este mundo.

765
01:12:16,707 --> 01:12:22,087
En ese caso... ¿vas a enseñarme
ese «terror»?

766
01:12:24,923 --> 01:12:25,923
No...

767
01:12:26,675 --> 01:12:30,554
Si me derrotas y vas tras Gaara,
te verás obligado a aprenderlo.

768
01:12:31,508 --> 01:12:34,135
Eso sí, solo si consigues derrotarme.

769
01:13:12,262 --> 01:13:14,973
Yo soy del clan Aburame
de la Aldea de la Hoja...

770
01:13:15,759 --> 01:13:19,578
Cuando luchamos,
nunca subestimamos al oponente,

771
01:13:19,787 --> 01:13:21,246
por muy insignificante que parezca
un insecto.

772
01:13:21,271 --> 01:13:22,431
¡Te enfrentaré con todas mis fuerzas!

773
01:13:23,906 --> 01:13:24,906
¡Vamos allá!

774
01:13:42,626 --> 01:13:44,711
Bájame, Temari.

775
01:13:45,254 --> 01:13:46,713
¿Puedes moverte, Gaara?

776
01:13:51,718 --> 01:13:52,718
¡Gaara!

777
01:13:58,267 --> 01:14:00,727
<i>Kankuro está entreteniendo a Uchiha ahora mismo.</i>

778
01:14:01,604 --> 01:14:02,684
<i>Debemos aprovechar esta oportunidad...</i>

779
01:14:06,114 --> 01:14:08,158
<i>Si no nos movemos,
la operación...</i>

780
01:14:09,445 --> 01:14:10,445
¡¿Eh?!

781
01:14:10,904 --> 01:14:13,383
Temari, ve para allá.

782
01:14:13,407 --> 01:14:14,074
¿Qué?

783
01:14:14,283 --> 01:14:18,497
¡Lárgate! ¡Estorbas!

784
01:15:02,539 --> 01:15:03,624
<i>¡Veneno en la hoja!</i>

785
01:15:14,343 --> 01:15:18,347
<i>Ese es... ¡Sasuke Uchiha!
¡¿Ha pasado a Kankuro?!</i>

786
01:15:18,964 --> 01:15:21,258
<i>No... Lo mires como lo mires,
es demasiado pronto.</i>

787
01:15:22,328 --> 01:15:23,862
<i>¿Ha venido otro agresor?</i>

788
01:15:24,895 --> 01:15:27,689
No sé qué estáis tramando
los shinobi de la Arena...

789
01:15:28,440 --> 01:15:30,651
¡pero os detendré!

790
01:15:32,819 --> 01:15:33,819
Y...

791
01:15:40,322 --> 01:15:42,772
¡Averiguaré tu verdadera identidad!

792
01:15:47,442 --> 01:15:48,122
¡Gaara!

793
01:15:53,006 --> 01:15:54,006
<i>¡No me digas...!</i>

794
01:15:54,234 --> 01:15:56,991
<i>¡¿Va a despertar a esa cosa
en un sitio como este?!</i>

795
01:15:57,452 --> 01:16:00,330
<i>Esto no es ninguna broma...
Se me ha ido de las manos.</i>

796
01:16:01,390 --> 01:16:03,767
¡Para, Gaara!
¡¿Te has olvidado de la operación?!

797
01:16:04,226 --> 01:16:07,980
Tú, que eres fuerte...
Tú, al que llaman Uchiha...

798
01:16:08,689 --> 01:16:10,148
Tú, que tienes amigos...

799
01:16:10,956 --> 01:16:12,521
Tú, que tienes un propósito...

800
01:16:13,026 --> 01:16:16,863
¡Tú, que eres como... yo!

801
01:16:31,587 --> 01:16:35,967
Eres... mi...

802
01:16:38,455 --> 01:16:42,536
¡Mi presa!

803
01:16:47,352 --> 01:16:48,645
<i>¡Ha empezado...!</i>

804
01:16:55,235 --> 01:16:56,235
Eres ingenuo.

805
01:17:01,907 --> 01:17:02,908
¡Muy bien!

806
01:17:09,333 --> 01:17:10,333
<i>¿¡Insectos?!</i>

807
01:17:14,254 --> 01:17:16,054
Pensar que harías
un clon con insectos y

808
01:17:16,079 --> 01:17:17,748
lo harías rodearme por detrás...

809
01:17:18,008 --> 01:17:19,008
¡Nada mal!

810
01:17:19,718 --> 01:17:23,055
Tu alcance va de media
a larga distancia y usas una marioneta.

811
01:17:23,597 --> 01:17:25,325
No pensé que te fuera bien
en combate cuerpo a cuerpo.

812
01:17:25,349 --> 01:17:28,894
¡Conoces bien las debilidades
de un marionetista!

813
01:17:29,353 --> 01:17:31,838
Sin embargo, a partir de ahora,

814
01:17:31,863 --> 01:17:34,939
¡te mostraré la verdadera esencia de
este estilo de lucha con marionetas!

815
01:17:36,360 --> 01:17:40,113
¡El verdadero terror de mi marioneta, Karasu!

816
01:17:48,705 --> 01:17:50,874
<i>¡Esto es humo venenoso!</i>

817
01:17:56,296 --> 01:17:58,298
<i>¿He inhalado... un poco?</i>

818
01:17:59,132 --> 01:18:03,303
<i>Ya veo...
Así que el marionetista se esconde, ¿eh?</i>

819
01:18:18,610 --> 01:18:19,610
Escuchad, todos...

820
01:18:20,278 --> 01:18:23,824
Aunque aparezcan shinobi enemigos,
no os asustéis.

821
01:18:24,035 --> 01:18:25,870
Entrad rápido en la sala oculta.

822
01:18:29,079 --> 01:18:34,167
¡Vuestros sensei Jonin y Chunin os protegerán,
aunque nos cueste la vida!

823
01:18:44,596 --> 01:18:45,596
¡Oh!

824
01:18:46,179 --> 01:18:47,389
Konohamaru...

825
01:18:48,306 --> 01:18:49,391
¡Todo irá bien!

826
01:18:50,350 --> 01:18:51,727
Todos se están esforzando al máximo.

827
01:18:52,561 --> 01:18:54,604
Repelerán al enemigo en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.

828
01:19:05,464 --> 01:19:07,814
Grietas en el Monumento Hokage...

829
01:19:08,425 --> 01:19:10,093
<i>Qué mal presagio...</i>

830
01:19:24,282 --> 01:19:27,111
Ahora... ¡Déjame sentirlo!

831
01:19:29,139 --> 01:19:30,139
<i>¡Ese ojo!</i>

832
01:19:32,972 --> 01:19:35,350
<i>Ese ojo... de antes!</i>

833
01:20:14,935 --> 01:20:18,980
<i>No parece que esto vaya a terminar
para cuando llegues...</i>

834
01:20:19,722 --> 01:20:20,722
<i>Shino...</i>

835
01:20:27,169 --> 01:20:29,713
Parece que el veneno
ha empezado a extenderse.

836
01:20:30,784 --> 01:20:32,410
¡Voy a acabar con esto!

837
01:20:41,503 --> 01:20:42,776
<i>¡¿Insectos, otra vez?!</i>

838
01:20:43,630 --> 01:20:46,091
<i>Pero no debería poder
moverse en ese estado...</i>

839
01:20:50,944 --> 01:20:52,874
<i>Te lo voy a poner más fácil...</i>

840
01:20:55,892 --> 01:20:57,018
<i>¡Eh! ¡¿Qué pasa?!</i>

841
01:21:01,260 --> 01:21:02,344
<i>¿Qué está pasando...?</i>

842
01:21:05,968 --> 01:21:08,763
<i>¿Metió escarabajos en las articulaciones
para que la marioneta no pueda moverse?</i>

843
01:21:09,906 --> 01:21:12,075
<i>¡Ese era su objetivo desde el principio!</i>

844
01:21:13,368 --> 01:21:15,787
<i>Los escarabajos están atravesando
los hilos de mi chakra...</i>

845
01:21:16,746 --> 01:21:17,746
<i>¿Por qué...?</i>

846
01:21:18,832 --> 01:21:22,377
<i>¡Es verdad! Ahora lo recuerdo,
se alimentan de chakra.</i>

847
01:21:28,091 --> 01:21:29,843
<i>¡A este paso,
localizarán mi posición!</i>

848
01:21:33,722 --> 01:21:36,558
<i>¿Cortó él mismo los hilos de chakra...?</i>

849
01:21:47,903 --> 01:21:48,945
<i>¡Te has confiado!</i>

850
01:21:49,613 --> 01:21:53,325
<i>Reconectar al instante los hilos de chakra</i>

851
01:21:53,954 --> 01:21:57,290
<i>es un juego de niños para un
marionetista de primera categoría.</i>

852
01:21:59,331 --> 01:22:02,042
<i>Es un gran error si crees que
esto se ha acabado...</i>

853
01:22:02,918 --> 01:22:04,294
<i>¡solo con inmovilizar a mi marioneta!</i>

854
01:22:04,920 --> 01:22:07,672
<i>Hay mucho veneno
en la punta de la aguja...</i>

855
01:22:08,673 --> 01:22:09,673
<i>¡Muere!</i>

856
01:22:16,306 --> 01:22:17,807
<i>Así sin más, ¡¿los insectos...?!</i>

857
01:22:18,850 --> 01:22:20,894
<i>¡Han mordido y cortado
los hilos de chakra!</i>

858
01:22:34,741 --> 01:22:36,284
¡¿Qué?! ¡¿Por qué...?!

859
01:22:36,701 --> 01:22:39,454
¡¿De dónde han salido
estos insectos?!

860
01:22:40,670 --> 01:22:44,215
Cuando espantaste los insectos señuelo
de los hilos de chakra,

861
01:22:44,349 --> 01:22:45,392
bajaste la guardia.

862
01:22:45,919 --> 01:22:50,799
No te diste cuenta...
de los insectos que se retorcían tras de ti.

863
01:22:53,718 --> 01:22:55,804
Los insectos llevaban
todo el rato moviéndose...

864
01:22:56,888 --> 01:22:59,474
dirigiéndose hacia tu bandana.

865
01:23:00,058 --> 01:23:01,643
¡¿Q-Qué has dicho?!

866
01:23:02,219 --> 01:23:03,470
Aquel golpe de antes...

867
01:23:03,995 --> 01:23:09,083
fingí fallar y
te pegué uno de mis kikaichu.

868
01:23:11,027 --> 01:23:12,821
Y este escarabajo de mi frente...

869
01:23:14,072 --> 01:23:15,949
Así es... Es una hembra.

870
01:23:26,376 --> 01:23:29,337
<i>El veneno se ha extendido
por todo mi cuerpo, ¿eh...?</i>

871
01:23:31,256 --> 01:23:33,550
<i>Parece que no voy a poder
apoyarte...</i>

872
01:23:34,217 --> 01:23:37,804
<i>Lo siento, Sasuke Uchiha.</i>

873
01:23:43,101 --> 01:23:44,894
¡No hay escapatoria!

874
01:23:45,478 --> 01:23:50,191
¡No dejaré que escapes!
¡Sasuke Uchiha!

875
01:24:10,462 --> 01:24:13,590
<i>¡Tiene que ser broma!
¿Qué es esa fuerza tan descomunal...?</i>

876
01:24:14,674 --> 01:24:17,010
¿Me tienes miedo?

877
01:24:18,178 --> 01:24:19,554
<i>Es demasiado abrumador...</i>

878
01:24:20,805 --> 01:24:28,480
¡Sasuke Uchiha! ¿Tienes miedo?
¡¿Tienes miedo de mi existencia?!

879
01:24:29,121 --> 01:24:31,331
Tu odio y tu intención de matar...

880
01:24:31,775 --> 01:24:34,152
¿han dado paso al miedo?

881
01:24:34,831 --> 01:24:38,501
¡¿Eso es todo lo que vale tu existencia?!

882
01:24:39,233 --> 01:24:42,736
¡Lucha contra mí... y compruébalo!

883
01:24:43,703 --> 01:24:46,956
¡Tu valor! ¡Tu existencia!

884
01:24:47,665 --> 01:24:49,042
¡Experiméntalo!

885
01:24:49,876 --> 01:24:51,419
Si quieres una respuesta...

886
01:24:52,921 --> 01:24:53,963
¡Ven a por mí!

887
01:25:16,486 --> 01:25:21,282
Ahora, déjame divertirme un poco...
¡Sasuke Uchiha!

888
01:25:24,494 --> 01:25:25,912
<i>¡Acabaré con esto de un golpe!</i>

889
01:25:42,345 --> 01:25:43,345
¡Gaara!

890
01:26:10,748 --> 01:26:15,628
Acabo de darme cuenta de por qué...
¡es tan divertido!

891
01:26:17,297 --> 01:26:18,548
Este dolor...

892
01:26:19,674 --> 01:26:22,677
Derribar a un oponente
que me ha herido...

893
01:26:22,927 --> 01:26:25,388
¡y destruirlo por completo...!

894
01:26:25,726 --> 01:26:29,438
¡Eso me hará sentirme de verdad vivo!

895
01:26:31,425 --> 01:26:36,138
<i>Gaara nunca había sido herido,
pero este le ha dado dos veces.</i>

896
01:26:37,275 --> 01:26:40,111
<i>¿Es... un monstruo?!</i>

897
01:26:41,154 --> 01:26:44,199
<i>No... el verdadero monstruo es...</i>

898
01:26:46,159 --> 01:26:50,830
<i>Al menos Gaara solo ha
transformado el brazo derecho hasta ahora.</i>

899
01:26:54,555 --> 01:26:56,474
¡Más, más!

900
01:26:56,794 --> 01:26:57,794
<i>¡¿Qué?!</i>

901
01:27:09,182 --> 01:27:11,017
<i>¡¿Qué demonios es este tipo?!</i>

902
01:27:11,684 --> 01:27:13,186
<i>Uno tras otro...</i>

903
01:27:16,606 --> 01:27:19,108
¡Allá va!

904
01:27:20,902 --> 01:27:21,902
<i>¡Es aún más rápido!</i>

905
01:27:33,790 --> 01:27:36,751
<i>No puedo esquivarlo si no
anticipo sus movimientos.</i>

906
01:27:37,710 --> 01:27:40,004
<i>Si no tuviera estos ojos,
ya habría muerto hace tiempo.</i>

907
01:27:44,550 --> 01:27:45,750
<i>No puedo usar el Chidori otra vez...</i>

908
01:27:46,803 --> 01:27:49,806
<i>¡Técnica ígnea: Bola de Fuego!</i>

909
01:27:58,147 --> 01:27:59,947
<i>Así que la técnica ígnea no
funciona contra la arena...</i>

910
01:28:00,316 --> 01:28:02,318
<i>Y no solo eso,
este nivel de jutsu no...</i>

911
01:28:03,027 --> 01:28:04,487
¡Muere!

912
01:28:05,196 --> 01:28:06,864
<i>Al parecer... solo el Chidori...</i>

913
01:28:27,844 --> 01:28:32,348
Bueno, tu límite es de dos disparos al día.
Es todo lo que tienes por ahora.

914
01:28:36,010 --> 01:28:38,512
Este es el máximo de veces que puedes usar el Chidori
en un día

915
01:28:38,747 --> 01:28:39,832
con tus niveles actuales de chakra.

916
01:28:40,832 --> 01:28:43,835
Al fin y al cabo, el Chidori es una técnica
que solo se puede usar

917
01:28:43,860 --> 01:28:46,060
junto con el Sharingan
en combate real.

918
01:28:47,488 --> 01:28:51,701
Pero usar el Sharingan y
otro jutsu a la vez significa

919
01:28:52,160 --> 01:28:56,414
que el chakra de tu cuerpo estalla
y se consume de golpe.

920
01:28:57,582 --> 01:29:01,085
Aun así, eres uno de los más
impresionantes que he entrenado.

921
01:29:01,836 --> 01:29:03,046
Incluso con mi Chidori...

922
01:29:03,477 --> 01:29:06,229
si uso el Raikiri
cuatro veces en un día,

923
01:29:06,673 --> 01:29:09,175
agotaría por completo mi chakra.

924
01:29:10,587 --> 01:29:14,133
¿Qué pasaría si intentara
usarlo más de dos veces?

925
01:29:15,459 --> 01:29:17,628
El tercer disparo no se activará...

926
01:29:18,672 --> 01:29:19,840
¡Recuerda esto bien!

927
01:29:21,417 --> 01:29:23,710
Si intentas forzar la activación de un jutsu...

928
01:29:24,067 --> 01:29:26,319
no solo el jutsu
no se activará correctamente,

929
01:29:26,501 --> 01:29:28,336
sino que tu chakra se agotará por completo...

930
01:29:29,197 --> 01:29:31,240
¡Y en el peor de los casos, morirás!

931
01:29:34,035 --> 01:29:39,019
Aunque sobrevivieras,
no saldría nada bueno de ello.

932
01:29:41,042 --> 01:29:42,668
Especialmente en tu caso.

933
01:29:51,344 --> 01:29:52,470
¿Qué te pasa?

934
01:29:53,304 --> 01:29:56,474
¿El valor de tu existencia
se reduce solo a esto?

935
01:29:57,392 --> 01:29:58,851
Seré directo...

936
01:29:59,560 --> 01:30:02,230
¡Eres... débil!

937
01:30:06,359 --> 01:30:08,569
Eres demasiado optimista.

938
01:30:09,284 --> 01:30:11,578
¡Y es porque tu odio
es débil!

939
01:30:14,158 --> 01:30:17,286
¡El poder del odio es
el poder de la intención de matar!

940
01:30:18,155 --> 01:30:21,283
¡El poder de la intención de matar
es el poder de la venganza!

941
01:30:22,291 --> 01:30:23,291
Cállate...

942
01:30:25,503 --> 01:30:27,588
¡¿Entiendes
lo que significa esto?!

943
01:30:28,464 --> 01:30:29,464
¡Cállate!

944
01:30:30,004 --> 01:30:34,879
Eso significa...
¡que eres más débil que yo!

945
01:30:36,639 --> 01:30:42,687
<i>Itachi me eligió para ser el vengador...
¡para que lo matara!</i>

946
01:30:45,898 --> 01:30:47,442
<i>¡Soy un vengador!</i>

947
01:31:42,038 --> 01:31:43,539
<i>El Sello Maldito otra vez...</i>

948
01:31:51,172 --> 01:31:53,299
<i>¡Maldita sea...! Mi cuerpo...</i>

949
01:32:13,611 --> 01:32:15,738
<i>E-Este tipo...</i>

950
01:32:18,032 --> 01:32:19,032
¡Sasuke!

951
01:32:24,330 --> 01:32:25,487
Vosotros...

952
01:32:26,040 --> 01:32:27,040
<i>E-Esto...</i>

953
01:32:27,833 --> 01:32:29,669
<i>Probablemente luchó sin ningún cuidado...</i>

954
01:32:31,337 --> 01:32:32,547
<i>¡como aquella vez!</i>

955
01:32:36,008 --> 01:32:37,008
¡Sasuke!

956
01:32:37,510 --> 01:32:41,055
<i>¡Kakashi-sensei dijo que no había nada
de qué preocuparse con esa marca!</i>

957
01:32:41,222 --> 01:32:43,432
Así que dime... Sakura...

958
01:32:44,517 --> 01:32:45,517
¡Sakura!

959
01:32:46,394 --> 01:32:47,471
¡¿Qué quieres?!

960
01:32:48,604 --> 01:32:51,065
Este tipo... ¡¿Quién es?!

961
01:32:52,191 --> 01:32:54,610
Su aspecto exterior
es diferente, pero...

962
01:32:55,918 --> 01:32:57,837
es ese al que llaman Gaara.

963
01:32:59,626 --> 01:33:02,170
<i>Nací siendo un monstruo.</i>

964
01:33:03,786 --> 01:33:06,163
<i>Así que eso es lo que decía...</i>

965
01:33:06,789 --> 01:33:09,250
<i>Es el que hirió a Sasuke...</i>

966
01:33:09,543 --> 01:33:10,753
¡Eh, jovencita!

967
01:33:11,627 --> 01:33:14,797
Que sepas que
¡no soy de los que pelean!

968
01:33:14,964 --> 01:33:16,679
¡Eso se nota con solo mirarte!

969
01:33:18,843 --> 01:33:19,844
¡Sasuke!

970
01:33:21,012 --> 01:33:22,888
Ya veo...

971
01:33:24,140 --> 01:33:26,434
eres al que no logré matar entonces.

972
01:33:28,853 --> 01:33:32,189
¡C-Corramos! ¡Todos!

973
01:33:33,608 --> 01:33:35,610
¡Muere, Sasuke Uchiha!

974
01:33:40,448 --> 01:33:41,782
¡Apartaos!

975
01:33:56,756 --> 01:33:57,798
¡Sakura!

976
01:34:09,226 --> 01:34:10,227
¿Por qué...?

977
01:34:28,226 --> 01:34:29,226
Mamá...

978
01:34:41,464 --> 01:34:42,465
Yo...

979
01:34:46,722 --> 01:34:47,765
Yo...

980
01:35:25,456 --> 01:35:27,842
¡Eh, eres genial!

981
01:35:37,903 --> 01:35:38,977
¡Vaya!

982
01:35:40,561 --> 01:35:43,253
¿Puedes hacer comida también?

983
01:35:54,718 --> 01:35:56,178
¡Anda, calamar a la parrilla!

984
01:36:01,692 --> 01:36:02,693
¡Ramen!

985
01:36:09,013 --> 01:36:09,690
¡Cerezas!

986
01:36:12,596 --> 01:36:13,562
¡Langosta!

987
01:36:17,271 --> 01:36:20,118
Mmm... ¡Un bol de arroz con erizo de mar!

988
01:36:20,586 --> 01:36:21,683
¡Es genial!

989
01:36:22,410 --> 01:36:23,126
Bueno, entonces...

990
01:36:24,436 --> 01:36:25,812
¿Qué tal una gran montaña de caca?

991
01:36:26,035 --> 01:36:27,328
¿Puedes hacerlo?

992
01:36:33,196 --> 01:36:33,863
Temari...

993
01:36:35,080 --> 01:36:35,762
Kankuro...

994
01:36:36,455 --> 01:36:36,955
¡Sí!

995
01:36:43,611 --> 01:36:44,423
Gaara...

996
01:36:45,161 --> 01:36:45,855
¡Temari!

997
01:36:46,989 --> 01:36:47,554
¡Sí!

998
01:37:15,721 --> 01:37:17,180
Oye, Yashamaru...

999
01:37:18,481 --> 01:37:21,651
No me da sueño, ni siquiera de noche.

1000
01:37:21,806 --> 01:37:23,224
¿Por qué será?

1001
01:37:23,509 --> 01:37:25,094
Now, that's a problem.

1002
01:37:26,653 --> 01:37:29,989
Normally, when you close your eyes,
you get sleepy.

1003
01:37:30,302 --> 01:37:32,137
Really?

1004
01:37:33,643 --> 01:37:34,367
Hey...

1005
01:37:36,012 --> 01:37:40,684
Why... Why don't I have a mother?

1006
01:37:40,869 --> 01:37:41,870
Well...

1007
01:37:44,396 --> 01:37:47,591
You have me, Lord Gaara.

1008
01:37:49,689 --> 01:37:53,192
Because I am at your side...

1009
01:37:53,482 --> 01:37:54,650
... always.

1010
01:38:51,884 --> 01:38:54,345
Oh... a boxed lunch?

1011
01:38:54,762 --> 01:38:55,420
Yes!

1012
01:38:58,140 --> 01:38:59,825
Ready?

1013
01:38:59,850 --> 01:39:00,935
Over here!

1014
01:39:05,411 --> 01:39:06,411
Power shot!

1015
01:39:10,778 --> 01:39:11,946
What are we going to do?

1016
01:39:13,322 --> 01:39:16,495
We don't know how to
wall-climbing or anything...

1017
01:39:25,335 --> 01:39:26,670
Y-You're...

1018
01:39:34,760 --> 01:39:35,427
This...

1019
01:39:35,831 --> 01:39:36,957
It's Gaara...

1020
01:39:37,246 --> 01:39:38,581
R-Run!

1021
01:39:46,146 --> 01:39:47,146
Wait!

1022
01:39:47,356 --> 01:39:48,649
Don't leave me alone!

1023
01:39:51,151 --> 01:39:52,528
Help me!

1024
01:39:54,154 --> 01:39:55,154
<i>I don't...</i>

1025
01:39:57,491 --> 01:39:58,784
<i>want to be alone anymore!</i>

1026
01:40:06,333 --> 01:40:07,333
<i>Really...</i>

1027
01:40:08,627 --> 01:40:09,795
No!

1028
01:40:16,016 --> 01:40:18,018
Gaara! Please calm down!

1029
01:40:19,763 --> 01:40:20,763
Yashamaru...

1030
01:40:36,655 --> 01:40:38,115
It's no use after all...

1031
01:40:39,145 --> 01:40:40,647
The sand gets in the way.

1032
01:40:42,414 --> 01:40:43,582
Gaara...

1033
01:40:44,791 --> 01:40:45,834
Yashamaru!

1034
01:40:47,053 --> 01:40:48,763
I may not look it,

1035
01:40:48,980 --> 01:40:51,707
but Lord Kazekage charged me
to look after your physical condition

1036
01:40:51,732 --> 01:40:54,152
as a member of medical corps
and as your guardian.

1037
01:40:54,942 --> 01:40:57,778
Please do not do such things
in front of me.

1038
01:41:00,326 --> 01:41:02,545
Yashamaru... I'm sorry...

1039
01:41:04,059 --> 01:41:07,604
Oh, this? It's just a scrape.

1040
01:41:10,439 --> 01:41:11,607
A scrape...

1041
01:41:12,916 --> 01:41:13,744
Is it painful?

1042
01:41:16,170 --> 01:41:19,356
A little bit...
But it'll heal in no time.

1043
01:41:22,662 --> 01:41:24,127
What is pain?

1044
01:41:26,638 --> 01:41:30,475
I've... never been wounded, so...

1045
01:41:30,880 --> 01:41:32,757
I wondered what it's like...

1046
01:41:34,128 --> 01:41:35,380
Well...

1047
01:41:36,084 --> 01:41:38,127
How can I explain it?

1048
01:41:39,176 --> 01:41:42,054
It's distressing, or difficult...

1049
01:41:43,343 --> 01:41:45,887
In other words, when you're hit or cut...

1050
01:41:46,319 --> 01:41:50,323
Maybe I should say it's a feeling
of not being able to bear it,

1051
01:41:50,447 --> 01:41:51,863
of not being able to stay normal...

1052
01:41:53,332 --> 01:41:54,833
I can't say it well,

1053
01:41:54,858 --> 01:41:58,082
but I suppose it describes a situation
that's not very pleasant.

1054
01:42:00,572 --> 01:42:05,410
So... maybe I'm injured too?
The same as everyone?

1055
01:42:06,453 --> 01:42:08,080
I'm not bleeding, but...

1056
01:42:08,448 --> 01:42:11,055
I've been having a lot of
pain around... here.

1057
01:42:22,773 --> 01:42:25,639
Blood does flow from a wound
on the body

1058
01:42:25,664 --> 01:42:27,458
and the wound itself will be painful.

1059
01:42:28,000 --> 01:42:31,056
But as time passes, the pain
naturally disappears.

1060
01:42:31,562 --> 01:42:33,981
By using medicine,
the healing is even faster.

1061
01:42:35,716 --> 01:42:38,262
But what's truly dangerous is
a wound to the heart.

1062
01:42:38,762 --> 01:42:41,029
That's much harder to heal.

1063
01:42:42,197 --> 01:42:43,448
A wound to the heart?

1064
01:42:43,894 --> 01:42:46,994
A wound on the body and a wound
to the heart are slightly different.

1065
01:42:48,133 --> 01:42:51,348
Unlike a wound on the body,
there is no ointment and sometimes,

1066
01:42:51,587 --> 01:42:53,438
it might never heal
in one's entire lifetime.

1067
01:43:00,923 --> 01:43:04,437
But there is one thing that
can cure a wound to the heart.

1068
01:43:06,508 --> 01:43:08,659
However, this is a complicated medicine.

1069
01:43:09,148 --> 01:43:11,577
It can only be given to you
by another person.

1070
01:43:11,639 --> 01:43:13,891
What? What do I have to do for that...?

1071
01:43:15,065 --> 01:43:17,069
The thing that can cure
a wound to the heart.

1072
01:43:17,983 --> 01:43:18,984
That is...

1073
01:43:21,919 --> 01:43:23,170
Love.

1074
01:43:23,947 --> 01:43:25,199
Love?

1075
01:43:25,532 --> 01:43:26,325
Yes.

1076
01:43:26,742 --> 01:43:31,372
H-How can I get it?
What do I have to do to receive it...?

1077
01:43:31,849 --> 01:43:35,186
You've already been given it, Gaara.

1078
01:43:35,390 --> 01:43:36,289
Huh?

1079
01:43:40,356 --> 01:43:44,803
Love is... the desire to serve
someone precious to you,

1080
01:43:45,190 --> 01:43:49,595
to cherish them and watch over them,
just as my older sister did for you.

1081
01:43:50,466 --> 01:43:54,019
I believe that my older sister
loved you, Gaara.

1082
01:43:54,535 --> 01:43:59,623
The sand which automatically tries to
protect you is like the love of a mother.

1083
01:44:00,633 --> 01:44:05,013
I believe that sand is filled
with your mother's will.

1084
01:44:06,878 --> 01:44:12,425
My sister... likely wanted to
protect you even after death...

1085
01:44:15,784 --> 01:44:16,792
Yashamaru...

1086
01:44:17,755 --> 01:44:18,627
What is it?

1087
01:44:19,732 --> 01:44:23,819
Thanks for what you did earlier...
for stopping me.

1088
01:44:24,629 --> 01:44:25,842
You're welcome.

1089
01:44:27,300 --> 01:44:31,346
You are a precious person
who is near me, Gaara!

1090
01:44:42,041 --> 01:44:45,639
<i>Can you understand... my pain?</i>

1091
01:44:52,910 --> 01:44:54,537
<i>It tastes like iron...</i>

1092
01:44:57,708 --> 01:45:01,003
<i>Hey, Yashamaru...
I have a favor to ask!</i>

1093
01:45:01,739 --> 01:45:02,739
<i>What is it?</i>

1094
01:45:04,137 --> 01:45:05,638
<i>I want some ointment.</i>

1095
01:45:15,801 --> 01:45:18,763
Sorry about earlier...
It must've hurt.

1096
01:45:19,356 --> 01:45:21,483
This is medicine.

1097
01:45:21,853 --> 01:45:22,687
If you want it-

1098
01:45:22,794 --> 01:45:24,796
Go home... freak!

1099
01:45:37,309 --> 01:45:40,103
<i>As I thought...
Things don't go well...</i>

1100
01:45:44,254 --> 01:45:47,674
<i>Why is it... that I'm the only one
who's such a freak?!</i>

1101
01:45:49,573 --> 01:45:52,075
<i>What... am I?!</i>

1102
01:45:53,180 --> 01:45:56,850
<i>The thing that can cure
a wound to the heart is love.</i>

1103
01:45:58,318 --> 01:45:59,694
<i>Yashamaru!</i>

1104
01:46:14,242 --> 01:46:17,079
<i>Why? Why me...?</i>

1105
01:46:17,746 --> 01:46:19,289
<i>Why is it always me?!</i>

1106
01:47:00,728 --> 01:47:03,856
Well done... Gaara.

1107
01:47:08,164 --> 01:47:10,653
Wh-Why...? Why would you do that?!

1108
01:47:11,425 --> 01:47:13,301
Why Yashamaru...?

1109
01:47:14,094 --> 01:47:15,971
Why did you, why...?

1110
01:47:18,525 --> 01:47:21,904
I was ordered to kill you...

1111
01:47:25,296 --> 01:47:26,672
By your father...

1112
01:47:28,230 --> 01:47:29,498
Lord Kazekage.

1113
01:47:32,904 --> 01:47:34,030
My father...?

1114
01:47:42,747 --> 01:47:44,833
Why did my father...?

1115
01:47:45,167 --> 01:47:46,418
Why...? Why me?

1116
01:47:47,627 --> 01:47:51,423
You have been watched over
as an experiment.

1117
01:47:53,863 --> 01:47:58,071
Gaara, you couldn't
control the Shukaku...

1118
01:47:58,096 --> 01:48:01,766
a spirit that commands
the power of sand.

1119
01:48:02,809 --> 01:48:06,980
Eventually, your existence would
become too dangerous for the village.

1120
01:48:09,566 --> 01:48:10,942
Before that occurred...

1121
01:48:14,112 --> 01:48:16,364
So Yashamaru, you had no choice...

1122
01:48:16,948 --> 01:48:18,658
you just had to follow my father's order...?

1123
01:48:20,494 --> 01:48:22,954
No... That is not correct.

1124
01:48:25,486 --> 01:48:28,197
It is true I accepted
Lord Kazekage's order.

1125
01:48:29,255 --> 01:48:33,092
But if I had wanted to,
I could have turned it down.

1126
01:48:36,218 --> 01:48:37,218
Gaara...

1127
01:48:38,699 --> 01:48:42,911
Deep down in my heart,
I probably...

1128
01:48:44,601 --> 01:48:45,685
hated you.

1129
01:48:47,257 --> 01:48:50,009
You, who took the life
of my beloved sister at birth.

1130
01:48:50,744 --> 01:48:52,615
You are the child she left behind...

1131
01:48:53,726 --> 01:49:00,191
Since you were what she left behind,
I tried desperately to love you.

1132
01:49:00,995 --> 01:49:03,456
But... I never could.

1133
01:49:04,775 --> 01:49:07,806
My sister didn't choose to have you.

1134
01:49:09,166 --> 01:49:11,377
My sister became a sacrifice
for the village,

1135
01:49:11,589 --> 01:49:13,924
and she died while
cursing this village!

1136
01:49:15,643 --> 01:49:17,312
Since then, I probably...

1137
01:49:17,842 --> 01:49:21,513
have carried a wound
in my heart that would never heal.

1138
01:49:22,222 --> 01:49:25,600
Your name...
is the name my sister gave you.

1139
01:49:28,728 --> 01:49:30,814
"This child's name is Gaara..."

1140
01:49:31,606 --> 01:49:33,316
"A demon who loves only himself..."

1141
01:49:33,733 --> 01:49:35,485
"Love only yourself..."

1142
01:49:36,486 --> 01:49:39,447
"And fight only for
your own sake."

1143
01:49:40,657 --> 01:49:43,326
"If you do that,
you will continue to exist."

1144
01:49:43,950 --> 01:49:45,993
Such was the hope it contained.

1145
01:49:46,647 --> 01:49:47,647
However...

1146
01:49:47,837 --> 01:49:50,089
my sister did not give you this name

1147
01:49:50,114 --> 01:49:52,866
because she was concerned
about you or loved you...

1148
01:49:53,271 --> 01:49:57,567
The reason she gave you this name...

1149
01:49:59,843 --> 01:50:02,012
... was so that the deep-seated hatred
of my sister

1150
01:50:02,142 --> 01:50:05,062
who died hating and cursing
this village...

1151
01:50:06,745 --> 01:50:08,788
would remain...

1152
01:50:11,479 --> 01:50:13,273
and be known to all!

1153
01:50:30,040 --> 01:50:34,119
You were never... loved!

1154
01:50:41,551 --> 01:50:42,636
Please die...

1155
01:51:03,114 --> 01:51:07,035
<i>I believe that my sister loved you, Gaara.</i>

1156
01:51:08,119 --> 01:51:09,204
<i>Love?</i>

1157
01:51:54,066 --> 01:51:56,235
<i>Love only yourself.</i>

1158
01:51:56,598 --> 01:52:00,227
<i>And fight only for your own sake.</i>

1159
01:52:01,381 --> 01:52:04,134
<i>So that is Gaara...
That is me.</i>

1160
01:52:04,884 --> 01:52:06,386
<i>I finally understand.</i>

1161
01:52:08,513 --> 01:52:09,806
<i>I am alone.</i>

1162
01:52:10,724 --> 01:52:13,893
<i>I will no longer believe in anyone...
or love anyone.</i>

1163
01:52:15,603 --> 01:52:16,896
<i>I am alone!</i>

1164
01:52:22,152 --> 01:52:24,988
<i>Yes, I am all by myself.</i>

1165
01:52:32,036 --> 01:52:33,163
<i>It's those eyes...</i>

1166
01:52:36,458 --> 01:52:40,128
What's the matter?
Weren't you going to run away?

1167
01:52:42,338 --> 01:52:43,423
Sasuke...

1168
01:52:45,592 --> 01:52:46,676
Naruto...

1169
01:52:50,540 --> 01:52:56,230
What are these two... to you?!

1170
01:52:58,295 --> 01:53:01,691
T-These two are... my friends!

1171
01:53:02,233 --> 01:53:05,111
Try laying so much as
another finger on them!

1172
01:53:05,615 --> 01:53:07,513
I'll knock you out!

1173
01:53:13,995 --> 01:53:17,999
So... what's the matter?!
Weren't you going to knock me out?

1174
01:53:21,049 --> 01:53:22,309
Hurry up and come at me...

1175
01:53:29,427 --> 01:53:31,596
Damn it!

1176
01:53:39,145 --> 01:53:40,146
Damn it!

1177
01:53:48,029 --> 01:53:51,658
<i>Damn it! Things will get really bad
if they stay like this...!</i>

1178
01:53:55,495 --> 01:53:56,495
<i>I'll have to...</i>

1179
01:53:58,581 --> 01:54:01,125
<i>It's come to this...
Though it's going to use a lot of chakra...</i>

1180
01:54:03,086 --> 01:54:06,714
<i>There's no other way...
I have to summon Gamabunta!</i>

1181
01:54:07,215 --> 01:54:08,675
<i>Summoning Jutsu!</i>

1182
01:54:13,638 --> 01:54:15,265
What's this?! You're a little kid!

1183
01:54:15,729 --> 01:54:17,814
If you want something from me,
give me some snack!

1184
01:54:18,175 --> 01:54:20,662
If you don't, I won't play with you!

1185
01:54:20,687 --> 01:54:24,207
You know something?
I hate frogs!

1186
01:54:24,232 --> 01:54:27,485
What did you say?!
Don't make fun of amphibians! I'm serious!

1187
01:54:28,361 --> 01:54:32,157
Eh! I don't have time to
play with you, little squirt!

1188
01:54:34,826 --> 01:54:36,619
<i>Damn! Why is it...?</i>

1189
01:54:36,817 --> 01:54:40,321
<i>I practiced for so long, but if  this is
all I can summon, there's no other way...</i>

1190
01:54:41,249 --> 01:54:43,167
I need to save everyone!

1191
01:54:44,935 --> 01:54:46,821
Everyone... you say?

1192
01:54:47,171 --> 01:54:48,464
Don't make me laugh.

1193
01:54:48,923 --> 01:54:51,843
I fight... only for myself!

1194
01:54:57,181 --> 01:54:59,642
<i>He... he's transforming again!</i>

1195
01:55:03,479 --> 01:55:07,275
If you don't take me down,
the sand holding this girl will remain!

1196
01:55:07,901 --> 01:55:11,143
Not only that, as time passes...

1197
01:55:11,168 --> 01:55:14,588
the sand will slowly squeeze tighter
and eventually suffocate this girl!

1198
01:55:15,950 --> 01:55:16,829
<i>Sakura!</i>

1199
01:55:18,036 --> 01:55:20,413
<i>He's getting closer and closer
to a full transformation.</i>

1200
01:55:21,568 --> 01:55:23,779
<i>That jutsu hasn't been activated yet,</i>

1201
01:55:24,125 --> 01:55:25,835
<i>but at this rate, I'll also be...!</i>

1202
01:55:26,669 --> 01:55:28,087
<i>Sand Shuriken!</i>

1203
01:55:37,347 --> 01:55:39,057
You're... really weak!

1204
01:55:39,864 --> 01:55:40,665
Shut up!

1205
01:55:40,999 --> 01:55:42,757
Just what is that guy?

1206
01:55:52,609 --> 01:55:54,653
<i>Wh-What lonely eyes...</i>

1207
01:55:55,093 --> 01:55:57,095
<i>I don't know what happened, but...</i>

1208
01:55:57,957 --> 01:56:01,127
<i>This guy's always been
suffering all alone...</i>

1209
01:56:01,864 --> 01:56:03,532
<i>Even now,
without ever feeling relief...</i>

1210
01:56:04,040 --> 01:56:07,210
<i>Only able to believe in himself...</i>

1211
01:56:07,951 --> 01:56:10,454
<i>Even now,
he's battling in hell...</i>

1212
01:56:13,675 --> 01:56:16,719
What's the matter?!
Are you afraid of me?

1213
01:56:17,091 --> 01:56:20,970
Fighting for yourself?
Fighting for others?

1214
01:56:21,536 --> 01:56:26,041
You should just love yourself,
and fight for yourself!

1215
01:56:26,573 --> 01:56:29,826
That's what it means to be strong!

1216
01:56:31,167 --> 01:56:32,710
Now fight me!

1217
01:56:33,077 --> 01:56:34,995
What happened to
the boldness you had earlier?!

1218
01:56:35,416 --> 01:56:39,879
Show me your strength!
I'll crush that strength underfoot!

1219
01:56:42,034 --> 01:56:46,538
Now what's the matter?!
If you don't fight me I'll kill that girl!

1220
01:56:49,564 --> 01:56:51,024
Damn it!

1221
01:56:52,021 --> 01:56:54,065
<i>Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu!</i>

1222
01:56:57,301 --> 01:56:58,386
<i>Wind Style:</i>

1223
01:57:00,513 --> 01:57:03,433
<i>Infinite Sandstorm Devastation!</i>

1224
01:57:08,229 --> 01:57:11,065
<i>This isn't good...
He really got me.</i>

1225
01:57:11,441 --> 01:57:14,318
First, I'll toy with you
without killing you!

1226
01:57:14,444 --> 01:57:17,196
I look forward to seeing
when and how you give up

1227
01:57:17,221 --> 01:57:18,806
and abandon your precious friends!

1228
01:57:25,872 --> 01:57:28,124
<i>But... what is it?</i>

1229
01:57:30,752 --> 01:57:31,919
It's far from over!

1230
01:57:38,593 --> 01:57:41,262
<i>What is this... this feeling?</i>

1231
01:57:42,263 --> 01:57:43,598
<i>Sand Shuriken!</i>

1232
01:57:50,271 --> 01:57:52,982
D-Damn it!

1233
01:57:53,775 --> 01:57:55,234
Damn it!

1234
01:57:55,777 --> 01:57:57,445
H-He's...

1235
01:57:58,446 --> 01:58:02,533
<i>What is this?!
This feeling that's overcoming me?</i>

1236
01:58:04,846 --> 01:58:07,641
<i>For some reason...
I don't want to lose to this guy...</i>

1237
01:58:07,960 --> 01:58:09,754
You...

1238
01:58:13,011 --> 01:58:14,943
<i>... even if I die!</i>

1239
01:58:15,379 --> 01:58:16,506
What's the matter?

1240
01:58:17,006 --> 01:58:19,675
After pursuing me like that,
what's up with you?

1241
01:58:20,127 --> 01:58:22,958
You're not even able to touch me...

1242
01:58:23,721 --> 01:58:25,056
What a joke!

1243
01:58:27,183 --> 01:58:28,183
<i>Sakura...</i>

1244
01:58:32,271 --> 01:58:35,024
<i>I don't know how far I can go, but...</i>

1245
01:58:36,359 --> 01:58:39,695
I have to give it... my best shot!

1246
01:58:39,904 --> 01:58:41,280
<i>Shadow Clone Jutsu!</i>

1247
01:58:47,078 --> 01:58:48,246
Here goes!

1248
01:58:48,412 --> 01:58:50,915
This is my ultimate secret taijutsu!

1249
01:58:51,207 --> 01:58:55,294
Naruto Uzumaki...
Clone Body Slam!

1250
01:59:00,925 --> 01:59:01,509
- Now!
- Now!

1251
01:59:01,634 --> 01:59:02,760
Okay!

1252
01:59:04,846 --> 01:59:06,472
<i>Shadow Clone Jutsu!</i>

1253
01:59:07,765 --> 01:59:10,768
Once again...
<i>Shadow Clone Jutsu!</i>

1254
01:59:12,603 --> 01:59:13,396
Take this!

1255
01:59:13,437 --> 01:59:15,606
Hidden Leaf Secret Ultimate
Taijutsu Technique,

1256
01:59:15,648 --> 01:59:17,150
learned from Kakashi-sensei!

1257
01:59:18,526 --> 01:59:20,611
<i>A Thousand Years of Death!</i>

1258
01:59:26,242 --> 01:59:27,121
Gotcha.

1259
01:59:37,295 --> 01:59:40,631
Doing all that work...
And managing just one blow, huh?

1260
01:59:40,840 --> 01:59:43,092
S-Shut up!

1261
01:59:45,219 --> 01:59:49,515
<i>He attacked the base of the tail
which has the weakest defense...</i>

1262
01:59:50,130 --> 01:59:53,967
<i>Even though I'm not wounded,
I can't absorb the impact.</i>

1263
01:59:55,813 --> 01:59:57,315
<i>Did I underestimate him too much?</i>

1264
02:00:01,527 --> 02:00:02,737
Hey, Naruto...

1265
02:00:04,262 --> 02:00:07,766
Sakura... Rescue her,
even if it's the last thing you do!

1266
02:00:09,368 --> 02:00:10,608
And after you've rescued her...

1267
02:00:11,743 --> 02:00:13,620
take Sakura and get out of here.

1268
02:00:15,082 --> 02:00:16,292
You, if anyone, can do it!

1269
02:00:18,912 --> 02:00:23,166
I can still... hold him off for a while.

1270
02:00:25,801 --> 02:00:28,346
I lost everything once...

1271
02:00:29,267 --> 02:00:31,937
I don't want to see...

1272
02:00:32,767 --> 02:00:36,187
any precious comrades die
right before my eyes again.

1273
02:00:37,605 --> 02:00:40,233
Precious... comrades...

1274
02:00:41,734 --> 02:00:42,985
<i>I will not allow my comrades...</i>

1275
02:00:44,111 --> 02:00:46,614
<i>to be killed, no matter what.</i>

1276
02:00:52,411 --> 02:00:53,411
I see...

1277
02:00:57,866 --> 02:00:59,273
That's right.

1278
02:01:01,645 --> 02:01:03,522
Because he has gone through life

1279
02:01:03,547 --> 02:01:06,092
with the same loneliness
and sadness as I have...

1280
02:01:06,634 --> 02:01:11,389
That guy who continued to fight
in solitude for himself,

1281
02:01:11,497 --> 02:01:13,598
I thought... he was strong.

1282
02:01:15,726 --> 02:01:16,727
Naruto...

1283
02:01:17,186 --> 02:01:21,774
But that's not what true strength is...

1284
02:01:22,441 --> 02:01:24,735
If one fights just for
oneself in solitude...

1285
02:01:25,111 --> 02:01:27,780
one can't really become strong...

1286
02:01:30,140 --> 02:01:34,477
<i>When a person has something
precious they want to protect...</i>

1287
02:01:37,833 --> 02:01:42,171
<i>that's when... they can truly
become strong.</i>

1288
02:01:47,425 --> 02:01:50,594
<i>You will... become strong.</i>

1289
02:01:56,017 --> 02:01:58,686
<i>He's releasing such a
massive amount of chakra!</i>

1290
02:02:00,062 --> 02:02:02,356
<i>That's... Naruto?!</i>

1291
02:02:04,532 --> 02:02:06,660
No matter what, I will...

1292
02:02:09,822 --> 02:02:12,033
protect you!

1293
02:02:21,375 --> 02:02:23,377
<i>Multi-Shadow Clone Jutsu!</i>

1294
02:02:29,550 --> 02:02:32,428
I've kept you waiting
a long time!

1295
02:02:33,304 --> 02:02:37,016
The First Scroll of the Naruto Uzumaki
Ninja Chronicles begins now!

1296
02:02:37,266 --> 02:02:40,978
Wh-What's up with this...
large number of clones?!

1297
02:02:41,562 --> 02:02:42,980
What the hell is this?

1298
02:02:43,481 --> 02:02:46,734
T-This is... amazing!

1299
02:02:47,985 --> 02:02:51,072
You are pretty promising.

1300
02:02:51,572 --> 02:02:53,532
You... This is...

1301
02:02:53,949 --> 02:02:57,161
Sasuke, you get yourself
a good rest.

1302
02:02:57,828 --> 02:03:01,415
Leave the rest to Naruto Uzumaki!

1303
02:03:03,686 --> 02:03:04,686
<i>This guy is...</i>

1304
02:03:05,836 --> 02:03:09,507
Alright, everyone! Here we go!

1305
02:03:10,788 --> 02:03:13,333
<i>That's Naruto?!</i>

1306
02:03:18,557 --> 02:03:19,809
Jump!

1307
02:03:20,684 --> 02:03:23,854
Naruto's... Ninja... Handbook!

1308
02:03:27,108 --> 02:03:28,526
Everywhere...

1309
02:03:28,734 --> 02:03:30,403
Shuriken!

1310
02:03:31,404 --> 02:03:33,322
<i>My body hasn't fully recovered...</i>

1311
02:03:33,364 --> 02:03:35,491
<i>My only choice is to
use Sand as a defense!</i>

1312
02:03:41,122 --> 02:03:46,001
- U-zu-ma-ki... Naruto Two Thousand Combo!
- U-zu-ma-ki... Naruto Two Thousand Combo!

1313
02:03:59,890 --> 02:04:01,350
- Barrage!
- Barrage!

1314
02:04:07,356 --> 02:04:09,608
<i>T-This guy...!</i>

1315
02:04:09,900 --> 02:04:11,545
- This time, I'll use both legs...
- This time, I'll use both legs...

1316
02:04:11,569 --> 02:04:13,654
- and make it a Four Thousand Hit Barrage!
- And make it a Four Thousand Hit Barrage!

1317
02:04:14,280 --> 02:04:17,283
<i>Where does that strength come from?</i>

1318
02:04:18,200 --> 02:04:22,121
<i>No way!
There's no way...</i>

1319
02:04:24,419 --> 02:04:29,507
<i>No way I'll... lose to... a guy like this!</i>

1320
02:04:41,765 --> 02:04:43,642
Wh-What's... that?

1321
02:04:51,108 --> 02:04:53,486
<i>It finally... emerged.</i>

1322
02:05:10,294 --> 02:05:11,587
<i>He's fully transformed!</i>

1323
02:05:16,133 --> 02:05:20,387
This is...
the monster inside that guy.

1324
02:05:25,017 --> 02:05:26,017
Naruto!

1325
02:05:28,437 --> 02:05:30,397
Damn... my body!

1326
02:05:32,399 --> 02:05:35,694
<i>My chakra is almost gone...
from all those clones earlier...</i>

1327
02:05:41,784 --> 02:05:42,515
<i>Sakura!</i>

1328
02:05:47,414 --> 02:05:49,333
This will mark your end...

1329
02:05:49,989 --> 02:05:51,135
<i>Sand Burial!</i>

1330
02:05:51,159 --> 02:05:52,408
<i>Summoning Jutsu!</i>

1331
02:06:00,386 --> 02:06:01,637
I will protect...

1332
02:06:03,180 --> 02:06:04,723
Sakura!

1333
02:06:10,020 --> 02:06:12,398
Naruto Uzumaki...

1334
02:06:15,943 --> 02:06:19,989
You continue to provide
such exquisite entertainment...

1335
02:06:20,489 --> 02:06:24,577
<i>Naruto...
What in the... world...?</i>

1336
02:06:25,244 --> 02:06:28,539
Not you again!
What in the world do you want?

1337
02:06:29,582 --> 02:06:30,582
Huh?!

1338
02:06:31,500 --> 02:06:35,671
That must be...
the Shukaku of the Sand.

1339
02:06:36,505 --> 02:06:40,050
Boss Toad!
You have to help me fight!

1340
02:06:44,513 --> 02:06:45,514
No way!

1341
02:06:45,598 --> 02:06:46,724
What?!

1342
02:06:47,433 --> 02:06:50,936
Why would I go out of my way
and fight a guy like that?

1343
02:06:51,434 --> 02:06:53,061
That's idiotic!

1344
02:06:53,188 --> 02:06:54,523
Why?!

1345
02:06:54,690 --> 02:06:57,610
You told me the other day that you
would make me your henchman!

1346
02:06:57,860 --> 02:07:01,030
It's a boss's duty to help out
his underling!

1347
02:07:01,363 --> 02:07:03,198
That's respect and duty, right?!

1348
02:07:03,866 --> 02:07:07,578
It's true I told you
I'd make you my henchman...

1349
02:07:08,412 --> 02:07:12,708
But we haven't even exchanged cups
of sake to seal our relationship yet...

1350
02:07:12,791 --> 02:07:16,378
Gimme a break!
I'm still underage!

1351
02:07:16,462 --> 02:07:18,047
I can't drink alcohol!

1352
02:07:19,055 --> 02:07:22,517
Don't say that and just listen
to what this guy says, Pop!

1353
02:07:22,593 --> 02:07:23,855
Huh?! Pop?!

1354
02:07:24,595 --> 02:07:28,432
Why are you here, Gamakichi?

1355
02:07:28,668 --> 02:07:31,046
I had lots of time on my hands,
so I came to visit...

1356
02:07:31,685 --> 02:07:34,063
Huh? Huh?
You're father and son?

1357
02:07:34,614 --> 02:07:37,450
And that guy over there
tried to bully me!

1358
02:07:38,771 --> 02:07:40,648
What was that?!

1359
02:07:41,445 --> 02:07:44,573
When that happened,
this guy here rescued me...

1360
02:07:44,995 --> 02:07:47,206
He clashed with that monster...

1361
02:07:47,242 --> 02:07:50,037
Pretty interesting guy.

1362
02:07:52,331 --> 02:07:53,707
I see...

1363
02:07:54,958 --> 02:07:59,254
Kid...
I recognize you as my henchman...

1364
02:08:00,172 --> 02:08:04,885
and I'll show you what duty
and respect means!

1365
02:08:07,888 --> 02:08:10,099
Hang on tight!

1366
02:08:12,850 --> 02:08:14,936
How's that?!

1367
02:08:21,360 --> 02:08:22,444
<i>Awesome...</i>

1368
02:08:38,085 --> 02:08:39,920
<i>What a guy...</i>

1369
02:08:40,170 --> 02:08:41,422
<i>He's so heavy,</i>

1370
02:08:41,447 --> 02:08:43,657
<i>I could barely manage to
thrust my dagger through him.</i>

1371
02:08:44,378 --> 02:08:45,963
<i>If I don't hurry up,</i>

1372
02:08:46,016 --> 02:08:48,227
<i>this battle will change
the shape of the landscape.</i>

1373
02:08:49,085 --> 02:08:50,878
Hey! Hey! Boss!

1374
02:08:51,056 --> 02:08:54,268
Sakura is over that way,
so don't move that way!

1375
02:08:54,426 --> 02:08:56,720
Please lure him in this direction.

1376
02:08:57,119 --> 02:08:58,787
Sakura...?

1377
02:08:59,356 --> 02:09:01,942
That's his girlfriend, Pop.

1378
02:09:02,443 --> 02:09:04,069
I've got to take that guy down.

1379
02:09:04,614 --> 02:09:06,616
Otherwise, I won't be able
to rescue Sakura!

1380
02:09:10,075 --> 02:09:11,577
Interesting!

1381
02:09:12,286 --> 02:09:16,248
This is interesting, Naruto Uzumaki!

1382
02:09:16,415 --> 02:09:17,583
<i>T-This isn't good!</i>

1383
02:09:18,375 --> 02:09:20,711
<i>Gaara...
He's going to do it...</i>

1384
02:09:21,086 --> 02:09:22,421
<i>I need to get out of here!</i>

1385
02:09:42,649 --> 02:09:44,067
He's done it...!

1386
02:09:45,444 --> 02:09:48,322
Wh-What's going to happen, Chief?

1387
02:09:49,531 --> 02:09:52,951
When the host uses the Feigning Sleep Jutsu...

1388
02:09:52,976 --> 02:09:55,311
... Shukaku will appear!

1389
02:10:01,960 --> 02:10:06,089
I'm finally able to emerge!

1390
02:10:08,342 --> 02:10:13,305
Let's do this!
The guy I want to kill is you!

1391
02:10:14,640 --> 02:10:15,682
I'm going to jump...

1392
02:10:16,016 --> 02:10:16,558
Huh?

1393
02:10:16,850 --> 02:10:19,937
<i>Wind Style: Air Bullets!</i>

1394
02:10:22,773 --> 02:10:25,192
<i>Water Style: Water Bullets!</i>

1395
02:10:34,326 --> 02:10:36,995
That practically created a storm...

1396
02:10:37,746 --> 02:10:40,040
What kind of battle is this...?!

1397
02:10:43,710 --> 02:10:45,712
Chief! I told you,
not in that direction!

1398
02:10:45,836 --> 02:10:48,672
Shut up! I know!

1399
02:10:50,384 --> 02:10:51,885
<i>Air Bullets!</i>

1400
02:10:52,886 --> 02:10:54,054
<i>Water Bullets!</i>

1401
02:10:57,766 --> 02:10:59,059
Too bad...

1402
02:10:59,393 --> 02:11:01,313
This isn't good, Chief!
There's one shot left...!

1403
02:11:10,320 --> 02:11:12,239
Yeah! I killed it...

1404
02:11:12,281 --> 02:11:13,907
I killed it!

1405
02:11:17,911 --> 02:11:20,080
That hurts...!

1406
02:11:20,711 --> 02:11:22,254
How dare you shoot me

1407
02:11:22,330 --> 02:11:24,666
with bullets containing
stupid amounts of chakra!

1408
02:11:25,586 --> 02:11:29,214
Even I can't take that many shots!

1409
02:11:29,339 --> 02:11:31,091
What should we do?!

1410
02:11:31,383 --> 02:11:36,263
For a start,
wake up the host, kid!

1411
02:11:36,763 --> 02:11:38,015
That'll break the jutsu!

1412
02:11:38,098 --> 02:11:39,683
How do we go about waking him?!

1413
02:11:39,708 --> 02:11:42,628
Give him a good punch!

1414
02:11:43,687 --> 02:11:44,980
<i>Water Bullets!</i>

1415
02:11:45,647 --> 02:11:47,316
Like I'll take that!

1416
02:11:53,697 --> 02:11:57,576
Chief, I can't hit him
unless you hold him down!

1417
02:11:59,119 --> 02:12:04,333
This Toad doesn't have fangs or claws
to restrain that guy.

1418
02:12:04,750 --> 02:12:07,085
What should we do then?!

1419
02:12:07,451 --> 02:12:11,580
We'll use the Transformation Jutsu
and change into something that does!

1420
02:12:13,467 --> 02:12:14,509
But with that said...

1421
02:12:14,535 --> 02:12:17,413
I'm not particularly good
at transformations.

1422
02:12:17,512 --> 02:12:18,180
Huh?

1423
02:12:18,430 --> 02:12:23,393
So you will act as my will
and make the Sign!

1424
02:12:23,477 --> 02:12:24,686
Whaaaat?!

1425
02:12:24,770 --> 02:12:26,605
Time for a combined transformation!

1426
02:12:26,772 --> 02:12:28,106
Uh... Okay!

1427
02:12:28,815 --> 02:12:31,526
We got to have fangs and claws!

1428
02:12:31,818 --> 02:12:33,320
Umm...

1429
02:12:33,695 --> 02:12:35,489
Let's go!

1430
02:12:36,406 --> 02:12:38,784
Wait...
Say, w-wait a second...!

1431
02:12:39,826 --> 02:12:42,287
F-Fangs and claws... Fangs and claws...
Fangs and claws!

1432
02:12:44,081 --> 02:12:46,416
<i>Transform!</i>

1433
02:12:54,904 --> 02:12:55,749
That's the...!

1434
02:13:07,479 --> 02:13:09,898
All right! Now!

1435
02:13:09,940 --> 02:13:10,940
Okay!

1436
02:13:13,735 --> 02:13:15,195
Wake the hell up!

1437
02:13:20,575 --> 02:13:21,910
You jerk...

1438
02:13:22,713 --> 02:13:23,684
<i>All right!</i>

1439
02:13:23,912 --> 02:13:26,707
<i>Not that much time has passed
since the host went to sleep!</i>

1440
02:13:26,790 --> 02:13:29,876
<i>In that state,
one blow should be enough!</i>

1441
02:13:32,379 --> 02:13:34,006
Damn it!

1442
02:13:34,089 --> 02:13:37,467
I just got here!

1443
02:13:48,937 --> 02:13:51,523
<i>That guy interfered with my jutsu...?!</i>

1444
02:13:54,484 --> 02:13:56,319
<i>Sand Coffin!</i>

1445
02:13:56,445 --> 02:13:58,488
- Pop!
- Yeah!

1446
02:13:59,281 --> 02:14:00,866
Don't take me for a fool!

1447
02:14:11,752 --> 02:14:12,753
<i>Damn!</i>

1448
02:14:13,920 --> 02:14:17,090
<i>What kind of strength
does this guy possess?</i>

1449
02:14:17,369 --> 02:14:18,633
<i>This doesn't look good...!</i>

1450
02:14:18,759 --> 02:14:23,055
<i>Naruto and I have both
completely exhaust our chakra!</i>

1451
02:14:26,433 --> 02:14:31,104
You will be killed by me!
I will not cease to exist!

1452
02:14:48,246 --> 02:14:49,246
Twenty!

1453
02:14:56,379 --> 02:14:58,090
Twenty-one!

1454
02:15:12,604 --> 02:15:16,066
<i>Leaf... Hurricane!</i>

1455
02:15:19,444 --> 02:15:21,530
How many did you take down Kakashi?

1456
02:15:21,905 --> 02:15:22,989
Twenty-two.

1457
02:15:24,157 --> 02:15:26,660
Huh, it seems I win again!

1458
02:15:28,787 --> 02:15:31,289
That was my twenty-third.

1459
02:15:31,373 --> 02:15:32,958
Yeah, yeah whatever...

1460
02:15:33,750 --> 02:15:36,266
That try-hard attitude of yours
is what makes you cool!

1461
02:15:36,550 --> 02:15:38,385
That's the reason you are my rival!

1462
02:15:39,606 --> 02:15:41,066
- Let's go!
- All right!

1463
02:15:52,144 --> 02:15:54,396
You're still grabbing my arm...

1464
02:15:54,561 --> 02:15:56,054
I can't use my jutsu this way...

1465
02:15:57,649 --> 02:16:00,735
Come on,
let go of me once and for all.

1466
02:16:10,620 --> 02:16:16,126
I'm not letting your ambitions
interfere with the village... any longer...

1467
02:16:16,426 --> 02:16:21,514
There's no stopping my ambitions!
You will die here!

1468
02:16:22,090 --> 02:16:24,259
You old fool...

1469
02:16:24,926 --> 02:16:26,928
As the Third Hokage,

1470
02:16:27,311 --> 02:16:31,815
are you saying you still have
the power to save this village?

1471
02:16:32,851 --> 02:16:37,272
Do you understand...
the current situation?!

1472
02:16:38,024 --> 02:16:41,866
Don't underestimate the shinobi
of this village!

1473
02:16:53,496 --> 02:16:56,208
We will not allow you to take
even one step beyond this point!

1474
02:17:12,506 --> 02:17:13,327
<i>Sakura!</i>

1475
02:17:14,407 --> 02:17:17,994
<i>Rescue Sakura,
even if it's the last thing you do!</i>

1476
02:17:18,772 --> 02:17:21,983
<i>I'll protect Sakura no matter what!</i>

1477
02:17:23,246 --> 02:17:23,950
<i>Please...</i>

1478
02:17:28,420 --> 02:17:30,297
<i>Just a small amount is fine...</i>

1479
02:17:31,324 --> 02:17:32,086
<i>Give me...</i>

1480
02:17:37,717 --> 02:17:38,717
<i>Some chakra!</i>

1481
02:18:05,015 --> 02:18:07,392
What are you doing...?
There's only one opponent!

1482
02:18:19,596 --> 02:18:21,973
The Hyuga are the strongest clan
in the Leaf Village.

1483
02:18:22,294 --> 02:18:23,586
Don't forget that!

1484
02:18:27,173 --> 02:18:31,678
M-My... body... is immobilized...

1485
02:18:33,179 --> 02:18:35,015
Is this the first time
you're experiencing

1486
02:18:35,040 --> 02:18:37,584
the Leaf's prized Shadow Possession Jutsu?

1487
02:18:37,934 --> 02:18:40,520
Well, take this too while I'm at it...

1488
02:18:41,563 --> 02:18:45,066
The Leaf's hidden technique...
Shadow Strangle Jutsu!

1489
02:18:49,946 --> 02:18:51,531
<i>Expansion Jutsu!</i>

1490
02:18:58,872 --> 02:19:00,790
<i>Mind Destruction Jutsu!</i>

1491
02:19:05,503 --> 02:19:06,503
Wh-What's this?!

1492
02:19:07,380 --> 02:19:09,007
My body is... all on its own...!

1493
02:19:09,060 --> 02:19:10,395
S-Stop...

1494
02:19:11,051 --> 02:19:12,051
Stop!

1495
02:19:19,237 --> 02:19:20,910
Reminds me of the old days!

1496
02:19:21,394 --> 02:19:22,273
Yeah!

1497
02:19:23,375 --> 02:19:26,002
The original
Ino-Shika-Cho trio reunites!

1498
02:19:31,624 --> 02:19:33,042
Kuromaru... let's go!

1499
02:19:33,239 --> 02:19:34,000
Right!

1500
02:19:35,325 --> 02:19:36,868
In order to protect the village,

1501
02:19:36,975 --> 02:19:41,271
all Leaf shinobi are risking
their lives to fight.

1502
02:19:43,500 --> 02:19:50,590
Real strength doesn't lie
in mastering all jutsu!

1503
02:19:53,093 --> 02:19:55,220
<i>The poison in my body is...</i>

1504
02:19:56,012 --> 02:19:59,099
Don't move, Shino.
I've sent in my Parasitic Insects.

1505
02:20:00,183 --> 02:20:01,434
They are removing the poison.

1506
02:20:02,394 --> 02:20:03,394
Dad...

1507
02:20:05,605 --> 02:20:08,817
I believe I taught this
to you too, in the past...

1508
02:20:09,275 --> 02:20:11,611
It is when one protects
someone important...

1509
02:20:12,153 --> 02:20:15,990
that the true strength of
the shinobi will emerge!

1510
02:20:18,910 --> 02:20:21,413
<i>I will protect everyone!</i>

1511
02:20:26,398 --> 02:20:28,525
Here I come!
You stupid raccoon!

1512
02:20:28,628 --> 02:20:30,004
Die...!

1513
02:20:35,844 --> 02:20:36,844
Damn...

1514
02:20:38,555 --> 02:20:40,473
Damn it!

1515
02:21:08,710 --> 02:21:09,794
D-Did he win?

1516
02:21:10,731 --> 02:21:12,524
<i>A simple headbutt...</i>

1517
02:21:12,847 --> 02:21:15,599
<i>His manner of fighting
is incredibly clumsy,</i>

1518
02:21:15,831 --> 02:21:19,710
<i>but to think he could squeeze out
that much chakra at such a critical stage.</i>

1519
02:21:20,571 --> 02:21:24,242
<i>I've never seen a knucklehead ninja
like him before, but...</i>

1520
02:21:24,329 --> 02:21:27,415
<i>he sure is the first phenomenal kid
I've seen in a long time.</i>

1521
02:21:28,905 --> 02:21:31,992
<i>It's too bad that I can't
see this through to the end,</i>

1522
02:21:32,901 --> 02:21:35,528
<i>but I've reached my limit.</i>

1523
02:21:35,987 --> 02:21:38,698
Gamakichi, let's head home!

1524
02:21:38,847 --> 02:21:40,301
Okay! Pop!

1525
02:21:57,217 --> 02:22:01,054
As expected, even I...
am empty now...

1526
02:22:02,889 --> 02:22:04,349
You are too, aren't you?

1527
02:22:05,225 --> 02:22:10,438
We're much alike...
Let this be our final battle!

1528
02:22:14,734 --> 02:22:15,777
It appears that...

1529
02:22:16,236 --> 02:22:23,576
I don't have the strength left
to yank out your entire soul.

1530
02:22:24,352 --> 02:22:27,939
However, your ambition ends here!

1531
02:22:28,172 --> 02:22:29,172
Not yet!

1532
02:22:29,681 --> 02:22:32,058
There's no stopping my ambition!

1533
02:22:32,561 --> 02:22:34,229
I have a suitable punishment for you

1534
02:22:34,254 --> 02:22:39,759
who has become addicted to jutsu,
and who has overindulged in jutsu!

1535
02:22:39,927 --> 02:22:43,639
I will seal away your ability
to use ninjutsu!

1536
02:22:43,680 --> 02:22:44,764
What did you say?!

1537
02:22:53,898 --> 02:22:55,066
Don't tell me...?

1538
02:22:55,233 --> 02:22:57,151
Stop that!

1539
02:23:00,613 --> 02:23:02,031
<i>Seal!</i>

1540
02:23:11,541 --> 02:23:14,043
My... My arms...

1541
02:23:16,963 --> 02:23:20,592
Now... you can no longer use
either of your arms.

1542
02:23:21,342 --> 02:23:25,555
And since you can't use your arms,
you can't weave signs.

1543
02:23:26,139 --> 02:23:29,058
You can no longer perform any ninjutsu!

1544
02:23:29,309 --> 02:23:33,021
You old fool!
Give me back my arms!

1545
02:23:34,147 --> 02:23:36,816
Orochimaru, you fool...

1546
02:23:37,525 --> 02:23:40,486
It's unfortunate that
we can't leave together,

1547
02:23:40,987 --> 02:23:42,488
but, my disciple...

1548
02:23:43,781 --> 02:23:46,576
We'll meet again in the next world.

1549
02:23:46,784 --> 02:23:48,886
You old fool...
whose life is hanging by a thread!

1550
02:23:48,911 --> 02:23:52,540
How dare you! 
How dare you seal away my jutsu!

1551
02:24:06,304 --> 02:24:09,932
<i>In places where the Leaf dances,
a fire burns...</i>

1552
02:24:11,684 --> 02:24:14,356
<i>The fire's shadow
will illuminate the village...</i>

1553
02:24:31,663 --> 02:24:34,791
<i>And once more the Leaf will sprout...</i>

1554
02:25:01,317 --> 02:25:02,360
Sarutobi...

1555
02:25:03,437 --> 02:25:05,606
<i>At the very least this sword...</i>

1556
02:25:10,368 --> 02:25:12,578
<i>It was a fitting end
for somebody like you</i>

1557
02:25:12,846 --> 02:25:15,890
<i>who mastered the Way of the Shinobi.</i>

1558
02:25:22,345 --> 02:25:25,414
It feels like my arms are burning...

1559
02:25:25,904 --> 02:25:27,000
Lord Orochimaru!

1560
02:25:27,961 --> 02:25:29,403
This is where we call off our plan.

1561
02:25:30,763 --> 02:25:33,391
Release the barrier.
We're heading back.

1562
02:25:33,891 --> 02:25:34,475
- Yes!
- Yes!

1563
02:25:34,892 --> 02:25:35,892
<i>- Release!
- Release!</i>

1564
02:25:44,026 --> 02:25:45,066
We won't let you get away!

1565
02:25:46,279 --> 02:25:48,573
<i>Ninja Art: Spider Web Net!</i>

1566
02:25:50,324 --> 02:25:53,006
<i>An adhesive type of string
filled with chakra...?</i>

1567
02:25:55,435 --> 02:25:58,104
Kakashi! They're on the move!
Do we go after them?

1568
02:25:58,220 --> 02:25:59,527
No, wait, Guy.

1569
02:26:00,084 --> 02:26:01,084
That's right...

1570
02:26:01,858 --> 02:26:04,964
If you make a move without
any data on the situation up there,

1571
02:26:05,544 --> 02:26:07,175
you will get caught in
the enemy's trap.

1572
02:26:07,866 --> 02:26:10,994
So... are you just going to watch?

1573
02:26:11,665 --> 02:26:12,337
Kabuto?

1574
02:26:16,392 --> 02:26:17,769
So you did know, after all.

1575
02:26:18,314 --> 02:26:19,535
So... what are we going to do?

1576
02:26:20,099 --> 02:26:21,619
It's time we retreated.

1577
02:26:22,309 --> 02:26:23,805
You're going to run away
from me again?

1578
02:26:25,181 --> 02:26:26,250
Right now...

1579
02:26:26,826 --> 02:26:30,705
if we show our cards,
they're most likely going to be copied.

1580
02:26:31,924 --> 02:26:33,342
Then again,

1581
02:26:33,443 --> 02:26:38,240
it doesn't seem like you've completely
mastered that eye like the Uchiha clan.

1582
02:26:39,463 --> 02:26:40,160
Well then...

1583
02:26:51,272 --> 02:26:52,272
Temari...

1584
02:26:57,475 --> 02:26:58,475
Kankuro!

1585
02:27:17,677 --> 02:27:18,911
I'm leaving Sakura with you.

1586
02:27:31,636 --> 02:27:35,472
<i>Why is... this guy so strong?</i>

1587
02:27:50,854 --> 02:27:53,208
<i>I told you not to talk to that guy!</i>

1588
02:27:53,492 --> 02:27:54,492
<i>Let's go.</i>

1589
02:27:59,346 --> 02:28:02,022
<i>Oh, there! That's him...</i>

1590
02:28:04,488 --> 02:28:05,488
<i>Go away!</i>

1591
02:28:08,254 --> 02:28:14,218
<i>Monster! Monster! Monster...!</i>

1592
02:28:23,728 --> 02:28:25,479
<i>You monster! Die!</i>

1593
02:28:28,399 --> 02:28:31,360
<i>That's him... Don't get involved, fool!</i>

1594
02:28:34,921 --> 02:28:36,256
<i>Don't look at him!</i>

1595
02:28:39,374 --> 02:28:40,541
<i>Go away!</i>

1596
02:29:04,775 --> 02:29:08,237
<i>To them, I'm just an unwanted monster
they want to see disappear.</i>

1597
02:29:08,606 --> 02:29:13,235
<i>So what did I have in this life,
why did I keep living?</i>

1598
02:29:16,183 --> 02:29:21,397
<i>And at that moment,
I knew what I was.</i>

1599
02:29:22,654 --> 02:29:26,116
<i>That I...</i>

1600
02:29:28,025 --> 02:29:33,614
<i>that my existence didn't matter
to anyone else in the world.</i>

1601
02:29:34,610 --> 02:29:36,612
D-Don't come any closer!

1602
02:29:44,892 --> 02:29:51,148
Being all alone... That pain
is unbearable, isn't it?

1603
02:29:54,662 --> 02:29:56,330
I know how you feel...

1604
02:29:56,925 --> 02:30:00,345
I don't know why, but I understand
the pain in your heart so well.

1605
02:30:01,283 --> 02:30:06,288
But now... I have people who are
precious to me.

1606
02:30:09,458 --> 02:30:14,255
And I won't let those important people...
get hurt!

1607
02:30:16,021 --> 02:30:22,444
I will stop you... even if it means
I have to kill you!

1608
02:30:23,159 --> 02:30:24,159
Why...?

1609
02:30:25,333 --> 02:30:28,503
How can you...
fight so hard for other people?

1610
02:30:29,270 --> 02:30:33,190
They saved me from the hell
of being all alone.

1611
02:30:33,826 --> 02:30:36,120
They accepted me... for who I am.

1612
02:30:37,619 --> 02:30:40,772
That's why...
they're so important to me!

1613
02:30:48,002 --> 02:30:52,673
<i>Love is the desire to serve
someone precious to you,</i>

1614
02:30:52,953 --> 02:30:55,397
<i>to cherish them and watch over them...</i>

1615
02:30:56,964 --> 02:30:58,466
Love...

1616
02:31:00,326 --> 02:31:02,870
<i>That is why he's so strong?</i>

1617
02:31:05,342 --> 02:31:06,761
That's enough, Naruto...

1618
02:31:11,437 --> 02:31:12,813
Sakura is okay.

1619
02:31:14,432 --> 02:31:16,192
This guy's chakra must
be depleted as well...

1620
02:31:17,546 --> 02:31:19,626
The sand around Sakura
crumbled away a long time ago.

1621
02:31:20,315 --> 02:31:22,031
Oh, I see...

1622
02:31:29,225 --> 02:31:32,478
I've had enough... Let's stop this.

1623
02:31:32,812 --> 02:31:33,708
Gaara?

1624
02:31:35,873 --> 02:31:39,465
<i>I've never seen Gaara in such
a weakened state before...</i>

1625
02:31:40,955 --> 02:31:41,967
All right.

1626
02:32:02,447 --> 02:32:04,825
<i>Naruto Uzumaki, huh?</i>

1627
02:32:07,541 --> 02:32:10,085
<i>One of these days, even I...</i>

1628
02:32:13,624 --> 02:32:15,709
Temari... Kankuro...

1629
02:32:16,265 --> 02:32:16,876
- Huh?
- Huh?

1630
02:32:18,045 --> 02:32:19,045
Sorry...

1631
02:32:23,676 --> 02:32:25,636
D-Don't worry about it...

1632
02:33:30,951 --> 02:33:32,036
Rain...

1633
02:33:33,037 --> 02:33:34,747
The sky has started to weep as well...

1634
02:33:37,459 --> 02:33:39,086
We will begin the memorial service

1635
02:33:39,143 --> 02:33:41,645
for the Third Hokage,
who lost his life in this battle,

1636
02:33:41,927 --> 02:33:46,474
as well as the other victims
of this attack.

1637
02:34:06,127 --> 02:34:07,378
<i>Why?</i>

1638
02:34:09,150 --> 02:34:12,111
<i>Why did Old Man Hokage have to die?</i>

1639
02:34:21,523 --> 02:34:22,314
<i>Why...?</i>

1640
02:34:46,288 --> 02:34:47,414
For Hayate?

1641
02:34:52,788 --> 02:34:56,166
The Third Hokage's funeral
has already started. Make it quick.

1642
02:34:57,496 --> 02:35:00,624
You too, Kakashi.
You here for Obito...?

1643
02:35:02,441 --> 02:35:05,110
If you're always thinking of
an excuse for your tardiness,

1644
02:35:05,801 --> 02:35:07,551
you should just come earlier.

1645
02:35:12,052 --> 02:35:14,263
I do...
I've been here since the morning.

1646
02:35:17,448 --> 02:35:19,492
It's just that,
whenever I come here

1647
02:35:19,518 --> 02:35:23,564
I want to punish myself
for being such a fool in the past.

1648
02:35:31,030 --> 02:35:32,581
There are two bells.

1649
02:35:32,899 --> 02:35:34,561
The fact that there are
only two means...?

1650
02:35:35,075 --> 02:35:37,036
That one of us has to go
to the tree trunk...

1651
02:35:37,578 --> 02:35:39,872
You're quick on the uptake, Orochimaru.

1652
02:35:40,372 --> 02:35:42,875
All right! I'll make it!

1653
02:35:44,012 --> 02:35:46,155
Come at me with the intent to kill!

1654
02:35:58,724 --> 02:36:01,573
Jiraiya, I won the bet with you, didn't I?

1655
02:36:02,311 --> 02:36:04,201
You got tied to the tree trunk,
after all.

1656
02:36:04,288 --> 02:36:05,237
Shut up!

1657
02:36:05,506 --> 02:36:07,511
You're as flat as a cutting board.

1658
02:36:08,150 --> 02:36:10,986
What did you say?! You closet perv!

1659
02:36:12,321 --> 02:36:15,157
Okay, okay, that's enough.

1660
02:36:15,240 --> 02:36:17,076
Tsunade and Orochimaru go home!

1661
02:36:17,159 --> 02:36:18,160
Okay!

1662
02:36:30,172 --> 02:36:31,918
You are hopeless...

1663
02:36:32,695 --> 02:36:36,783
Ninja shouldn't be getting caught in
obvious traps like that over and over again.

1664
02:36:37,082 --> 02:36:37,942
But...

1665
02:36:38,282 --> 02:36:40,451
Why don't you learn a little
from Orochimaru?!

1666
02:36:41,537 --> 02:36:45,249
Sarutobi-sensei, you're always
saying Orochimaru, Orochimaru!

1667
02:36:45,708 --> 02:36:46,339
Hm?

1668
02:36:46,953 --> 02:36:50,563
When it comes to snooping,
I'm great at Transparency Jutsu.

1669
02:36:51,947 --> 02:36:52,920
Gimme a break...

1670
02:36:53,166 --> 02:36:54,918
I don't even want to know

1671
02:36:54,943 --> 02:36:56,254
what level of Transparency Jutsu
you possess...

1672
02:36:56,365 --> 02:36:59,564
I've never been caught once!
And that's the truth!

1673
02:37:01,398 --> 02:37:06,484
If you're that sure of yourself,
I'll go with you next time...

1674
02:37:10,546 --> 02:37:12,351
You're such a perv, Sarutobi-sensei...

1675
02:37:27,146 --> 02:37:28,605
Iruka-sensei...

1676
02:37:28,689 --> 02:37:29,689
Hmm?

1677
02:37:30,718 --> 02:37:35,040
Why do people risk their own lives
for other people?

1678
02:37:38,989 --> 02:37:42,158
When one person dies...

1679
02:37:43,894 --> 02:37:47,813
their past, present, and future
disappear along with them.

1680
02:37:48,980 --> 02:37:52,087
Many people die fulfilling
their duty in battle...

1681
02:37:52,754 --> 02:37:56,258
And all too easily.

1682
02:37:58,189 --> 02:38:00,066
Hayate was one of them.

1683
02:38:01,096 --> 02:38:04,641
Those who pass away also
have dreams and ambitions.

1684
02:38:05,767 --> 02:38:10,189
But everyone has something else,
just as important.

1685
02:38:11,440 --> 02:38:17,946
Parents, siblings, friends, lovers...
Those who are dear to them.

1686
02:38:19,422 --> 02:38:21,549
They trust each other
and help each other,

1687
02:38:22,191 --> 02:38:26,538
the people they've cherished
since the day they were born.

1688
02:38:27,956 --> 02:38:30,501
And that bond that connects people

1689
02:38:30,895 --> 02:38:34,296
becomes stronger and
thicker as time goes by...

1690
02:38:35,923 --> 02:38:37,466
It can't be explained by logic...

1691
02:38:38,287 --> 02:38:43,688
Those who hold those strings just do it,
because it's important to them.

1692
02:38:45,254 --> 02:38:49,197
Yeah, I kind of get it.

1693
02:38:50,248 --> 02:38:50,902
But...

1694
02:38:53,941 --> 02:38:55,484
It's tough to die.

1695
02:38:56,921 --> 02:38:59,424
It's not like he died for nothing.

1696
02:39:00,531 --> 02:39:03,158
He left us something very important.

1697
02:39:04,607 --> 02:39:07,535
Well, you'll eventually understand
one of these days.

1698
02:39:08,277 --> 02:39:11,614
Yeah, I kind of get that too!

1699
02:39:21,728 --> 02:39:23,614
Bye! Iruka-sensei!

1700
02:39:23,899 --> 02:39:24,607
Yeah...

1701
02:39:26,967 --> 02:39:30,695
<i>Lord Third Hokage,
the Will of Fire you spoke of...</i>

1702
02:39:31,573 --> 02:39:36,024
<i>seems to have been passed on
to the young Leaves.</i>

1703
02:39:37,985 --> 02:39:41,233
<i>The flame that you lit
in their hearts,</i>

1704
02:39:41,762 --> 02:39:45,019
<i>will burn bright and strong...</i>

1705
02:39:45,615 --> 02:39:49,404
<i>And it will shine upon this village,
and watch over and protect us.</i>

1706
02:39:54,935 --> 02:39:59,606
<i>He'll become Hokage... one day</i>

